{
  "title": "Ziyarah on the Day of Ghadeer",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Through authoritative chains of authority, It is narrated that Imam Ali ibn Muhammad al-Hadi (a.s.) said the following form of ziyarah at the holy tomb of Imam Ali Ameer al-Moamenin (a.s.) on the Ghadeer day when he was summoned by the Abbasid ruler, al-Mo’tasim, to be present before him in Iraq:\nWith the intention of visiting the holy tomb of Imam Ali (a.s.), you may stop at the gate of the dome of the holy shrine and seek permission of entrance. However, Shaykh al-Mufeed says that you may wash yourself, put on the cleanest of your clothes, and say the following form of seeking permission, which, beginning with the following statement, has been cited previously:\nاَللَّهُمَّ اِنِّىْ وَقَفْتُ عَلٰى بَابٍ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE WAQAFTO A’LAA BAABIN \nYou may then enter there with your right foot and walk until you stop at the holy tomb, which you may face and make the kiblah direction to be between your shoulders. There, you may say the following words:\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ رَسُوْلِ اﷲِ \nASSALAMO A’LAA MOHAMMADIN RASOOLIL LAAHE\nPeace be on Mohammad, the Apostle of Allah, \nخَاتَمِ النَّبِیِّیْنَ وَ سَیِّدِ الْمُرْسَلِیْنَ \nKHAATAMIN NABIYYEENA WA SAYYEDIL MURSALEENA\nthe Last of the Prophets and the leader of the Apostles \nوَ صَفْوَۃِ رَبّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ اَمِیْنِ اﷲِ \nWA SAFWATE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA AMEENIL LAAHE\nand the chosen one of the Lord of the Universe, the trustee of Allah \nعَلٰی وَحْیِهٖ وَ عَزآئِمِ اَمْرِهٖ وَالْخَاتِمِ \nA’LAA WAHYEHI WA A’ZAAEME AMREHI WAL KHAATEME \nupon His revelation and His intentions and the last \nلِمَا سَبَقَ وَالْفَاتِحِ لِمَا اسْتُقْبِلَ \nLEMAA SABAQA WAL FAATEHE LEMAS TUQBELA\nof those who preceded him and the beginner for all \nوَالْمُهَیْمِنِ عَلٰی ذٰلِكَ كُلِّهٖ وَ \nWAL MOHAYMENE A’LAA ZAALEKA KULLEHI WA\nthose who will come in the future and he is the guardian over all that and \nرَحْمَۃُ اﷲِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ وَ صَلَوَاتُهٗ وَ تَحِیَّاتُهٗ \nRAHMATULLAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU WA SALAWAATOHU WATAHIYYAATOHU\nthe Mercy of Allah and His Blessings and His Salutations and His Greetings.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلٰٓی اَنْبِیَآئِ اﷲِ وَ رُسُلِهٖ وَ \nASSALAAMO ALAA ANBEYAAILLAAHE WA ROSOLEHI\nPeace be on the Prophet of Allah and His Apostles and \nمَلآْئِكَتِهِ الْمُقَرَّبِیْنَ وَ عِبَادِهِ الصَّالِحِیْنَ \nWA MALAAAEKATEHIL MOQARRABEENA WA E’BAADEHIS SAALEHEENA\nHis proximate angels and His righteous servants.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA AMEERAL MUMINEENA\nPeace be on you, O the leader of the faithful\nوَسَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ وَ وَارِثَ عِلْمِ \nWA SAYYIDILWASEENA WA WAARISA ILMIN\nand the chief of the vicegerents and the inheritor of the knowledge \nالنَّبِیِّیْنَ وَ وَلِیَّ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ \nNABEENA WA WALEEYA RABBIL AALAMEENA\nof the Prophets and the representative of the Lord of the Universe \nوَ مَوْلاَیَ وَ مَوْلَی الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nWA MAULAAYA WA MAULAL AL MUMINEEN\nand my master and the master of the believers \nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اﷲِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ \nWA RAHMAT ULLAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand the Mercy of Allah and His Blessings be on you.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا مَوْلاَیَ یَا اَمِیْرَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA MAULAAYA YAA AMEERAL\nPeace be on you, O my master, O the leader \nالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ یَا اَمِیْنَ اﷲِ فِیْ اَرْضِهٖ وَ \nMOMINEENA YA AMEENALLAAHE FEE ARZEHI WA\nof the faithful, O the trustee of Allah in His earth and \nسَفِیْرَهٗ فِیْ خَلْقِهٖ وَ حُجَّتَهُ الْبَالِغَۃَ عَلٰی عِبَادِهٖ \nSAFEERAHU FEE KHALQEHI WA HUJJATUL BAALEGHATA A’LAA EBAADEHI\nHis representative in His cities and His cities and His all prevailing argument upon His servants.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا دِیْنَ اﷲِ الْقَوِیْمَ وَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA DEENALLAHIL QAWEEMA WA\nPeace be on you, O the upright religion of Allah and \nصِرَاطَهُ الْمُسْتَقِیْمَ \nSERAATAHUL MUSTAQEEMA\nHis straight path. \nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا النَّبَأُ الْعَظِیْمُ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAN NABA-UL A’ZEEMUL\nPeace be on you, O the great news concerning \nالَّذِیْ هُمْ فِیْهِ مُخْتَلِفُوْنَ وَ عَنْهُ یُسْئَلُوْنَ \nLAZEE HUM FEEHE MUKHTALEFOONA WA A’NHO YUS-ALOONA\nwhom they differ and about whom they will be questioned.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَآ اَمِیْرَالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA AMEERAL MOMINEENA\nPeace be on you, O the chief of the faithful, \nاٰمَنْتَ بِاللّٰهِ وَ هُمْ مُشْرِكُوْنَ \nAAMANTA BILLAAHE WA HUM MUSHREKOONA\nyou believed in Allah while they were polytheists \nوَ صَدَّقْتَ بِالْحَقِّ وَ هُمْ مُكَذِّبُوْنَ \nWA SADDAQTA BILHAQQE WAHUM MOKAZZEBOONA\nand you testified to the truth while they were the deniers \nوَ جَاهَدْتَ وَ هُمْ مُحْجِمُوْنَ وَ \nWA JAAHAD-TA WA HUM MOHJEMOONA WA\nand you strove and fought (in the way of Allah) while they expressed cowardice. \nعَبَدْتَ اللّٰهَ مُخْلِصًا لَهُ الدِّیْنَ صَأبِراً \nA’BADTALLAAHA MUKHLESAN LAHUD DEENA SAABERAN\nAnd you worshipped Allah sincerely, exuberating patience \nمُحْتَسِبًا حَتّٰی اَتٰیكَ الْیَقِیْنُ \nMOHTASEBAN HATTA AATAAKAL YAQEENO\nand forbearance till the time death overtook you.\nاَلاَ لَعْنَۃُ اﷲِ عَلَی الظَّالِمِیْنَ \nALAA L’ANATULLAAHE A’LAZ ZAALEMEENA\nBehold! Curse of Allah be upon the oppressors.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا سَیِّدَ الْمُسْلِمِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAYYEDAL MUSLEMEENA\nPeace be on you, O the chief of the submitters \nوَ یَعْسُوْبَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَ اِمَامَ \nWA YA’SOOBAL MOMINEENA WA EMAAMAL\nand the commander of the believers and the leader \nالْمُتَّقِیْنَ وَ قَآئِدَ الْغُرِّ الْمُحَجِّلِیْنَ \nMUTTAQEENA WA QAAAEDAL GHURRIL MOHAJJALEENA\nof the pious and the guide of those with radiant foreheads \nوَ رَحْمَۃُ اللّٰهِ وَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATULLAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nand the mercy of Allah and His Blessings.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَخُوْ رَسُوْلِ اللّٰهِ وَ وَصِیُّهٗ\nASH-HADO ANNAKA AKHOO RASOOLILLAAHE WA WASIYYOHU\nI bear witness that you are the brother of Apostle of Allah and his vicegerent \nوَ وَارِثُ عِلْمِهٖ وَ اَمِیْنُهٗ عَلٰی \nWA WAARESO I’LMEHI WA AMEENOHU A’LAA\nand the inheritor of his knowledge and his trustee on \nشَرْعِهٖ وَ خَلِیْفَتُهٗ فِیْ اُمَّتِهٖ وَ اَوَّلَ مَنْ \nSHAR-E’HI WA KHALEEFATOHU FEE UMMATEHI WA AWWALO MAN\nhis laws and his caliph upon his nation and the first of \nاٰمَنَ بِاللّٰهِ وَ صَدَّقَ بِمَآ اُنْزِلَ عَلٰی نَبِیِّهٖ \nAAMANA BILLAAHE WA SADDAQA BEMA UNZELA A’LAA NABIYYEHI\nthose who believe in Allah and to testify in whatever has been sent upon His Prophet\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّهٗ قَدْ بَلَّغَ عَنِ اللّٰهِ مَا \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAHU QAD BALLAGHA A’NILLAAHE MAA\nand I bear witness that surely he (Holy Prophet) conveyed all that was \nاَنْزَلْتَهٗ فِیْكَ وَ صَدَعَ بِاَمْرِهٖ وَ \nANZALAHU FEEKA WA SADA-A’ BE AMREHI WA\nrevealed concerning you from the side of Allah and complied with His commands and \nاَوْجَبَ عَلٰی اُمَّتِهٖ فَرْضَ طَاعَتِكَ \nAWJABA A’LAA UMMATEHI FARZA TAA-A’TEKA\nmade obligatory upon his nation your obedience \nوَ وِلاَیَتِكَ وَ عَقَدَ عَلَیْهِمُ الْبَیْعَۃَ لَكَ \nWA WELAAYATEKA WA A’QADA A’LAYHEMUL BAYATA LAKA\nand your mastership and he took your pledge of allegiance from them \nوَ جَعَلَكَ اَوْلٰی بِالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ مِنْ \nWA JA-A’LAKA AWLAA BIL MOMINEENA MIN\nand he declared you to having more authority over the believers than \nاَنْفُسِهِمْ كَمَا جَعَلَهُ اللّٰهُ كَذَالِكَ \nANFOSEHIM KAMAA JA-A’LAHULLAAHO KAZAALEKA\nthey have over their own selves just as Allah has made him such.\nثُمَّ اَشْهَدَ اللّٰهَ تَعَالٰی عَلَیْهِمْ فَقَالَ \nSUMMA ASH-HADALLAAHA TA-A’ALA A’LAYHIM FAQAALA\nThen he made Allah as a witness upon them and then said, \nاَلَسْتُ قَدْ بَلَّغْتُ فَقَالُوْا اللّٰهُمَّ بَلٰی \nALASTO QAD BALLAGHTO FAQAALUL LAAHUMMA BALAA\n‘Is it not that I have conveyed?’ They replied, ‘Yes, by Allah.’\nفَقَالَ اَللّٰهُمَّ اشْهَدْ وَ كَفٰی بِكَ \nFAQAALA ALLAAHUMMASH HAD WA KAFAA BEKA\nThen he said, ‘O Allah! You be a witness and You are sufficient as \nشَهِیْدًا وَ حَاكِمًا بَیْنَ الْعِبَادِ \nSHAHEEDAN WA HAAKEMAN BAYNAL E’BAADE\na witness and a judge between the servants.\nفَلَعَنَ اﷲُ جَاحِدَ وِلاَیَتِكَ بَعْدَ الْاِقْرَارِ\nFA LA-A’NALLAAHO  JAAHEDA WELAAYATEKA BA’DAL IQRAARE\nThen may Allah curse those who rejected your mastership after having attested to it\nوَ نَاكِثَ عَهْدِكَ بَعْدَ الْمِیْثَاقِ \nWA NAAKESA A’HDEKA BA’DAL MEESAAQE\nand they broke your promise after having made the covenant.\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ وَفَیْتَ بِعَهْدِ اﷲِ تَعَالٰی \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA WAFAYTA BE A’HDILLAAHE TA-A’ALAA\nAnd I bear Allah that you fulfilled the covenant of Allah, the High \nوَ اَنَّ اللّٰهَ تَعَالٰی مُوفٍ لَكَ بِعَهْدِهٖ \nWA ANNALLAAHA TA-A’ALAA MOOFIN LAKA BE A’HDEHI\nand that Allah will redeem His Promise to you and one who observed \nوَ مَنْ اَوْفٰی بِمَا عَاهَدَ عَلَیْهُ اﷲُ \nWA MAN AWFAA BEMAA A’AHADA A’LAYHULLAAHO\nwhatever he had promised to Allah, \nفَسَیُؤْتِیْهِ اَجْرًا عَظِیْمًا \nFASA-YOATEHI AJRAN A’ZEEMAN\nthen surely Allah will grant him a great reward.\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ اَمِیْرُ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ الْحَقُّ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA AMEERUL MOMINEENAL HAQQO\nAnd I bear witness that you are the leader of the faithful truly, \nالَّذِیْ نَطَقَ بِوِلاَیَتِكَ التَّنْزِیْلُ \nLAZEE NATAQA BE WELAAYETEKAT TANZEELO\nthe Revelation (Quran) speaks eloquently about your mastership \nوَ اَخَذَ لَكَ الْعَهْدَ عَلَی الْاُمَّۃِ بِذَالِكَ \nWA AKHAZA LAKAL A’HDA A’LAL UMMATEHI BEZAALEKAR\nand the Apostle took a covenant to this effect \nالرَّسُوْلُ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ وَ عَمَّكَ \nRASOOLO WA ASH-HADO ANNAKA WA A’MMAKA\nfrom his nation and I bear witness that you and your uncle \nوَ اَخَاكَ الَّذِیْنَ تَاجَرْتُمُ اﷲَ \nWA AKHAAKAL LAZEENA TAAJARTOMULLAAHA\nand your brother have all traded \nبِنُفُوسِكُمْ فَاَنْزَلَ اﷲُ فِیْكُمْ اِنَّ اللّٰهَ \nBENOFOOSEKUM FA-ANZALALLAAHO FEEKUM INNALLAAHASH\ntheir lives with Allah. Then Allah has revealed about you. \"Surely Allah \nاشْتَریٰ مِنَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ اَنْفُسَهُمْ \nTARAA MENAL MOMINEENA ANFOSAHUM\nhas bought from the believers their lives  \nوَ اَمْوَالَهُمْ بِاَنَّ لَهُمُ الْجَنَّۃَ یُقَاتِلُوْنَ \nWA AMWAALAHUM BE ANNA LAHOMUL JANNATA YOQAATELOONA\nand their wealth in lieu of Paradise, they fight in the way of Allah \nفِیْ سَبِیْلِ اللّٰهِ فَیَقْتُلُوْنَ وَ یُقْتَلُوْنَ \nFEE SABEELILLAAHE FAYAQTOLOONA WA YUQTALOONA\nand they kill and are killed, \nوَعْدًا عَلَیْهِ حَقًّا فِی التَّوْرٰیۃِ \nWA’DAN A’LAYHE HAQQAN FEET TAWRAATE\nAllah’s Promise is true which is mentioned in the Torah,\nوَالْاِنْجِیْلِ وَالْقُرْاٰنِ وَ مَنْ اَوْفٰی \nWAL INJEELE WAL QUR-AANE WA MAN AWFAA\nthe Bible and the Holy Quran and whoever fulfills \nبَعَهْدِهٖ مِنَ اللّٰهِ فَاسْتَبْشِرُوْا بِبَیْعِكُمُ \nBE A’HDEHI MENALLAAHE FASTABASHERU  BE BAY-E’KOMUL\nhis covenant with Allah then give him glad tidings of your trading\nالَّذِیْ بَایَعْتُمْ بِهٖ وَ ذٰلِكَ هُوَ الْفَوْزُ \nLAZEE BAAYA’TUM BEHI WA ZAALEKA HOWAL FAWZUL \nof what you have traded and that is a great \nالْعَظِیْمُ التَّآئِبُوْنَ الْعَابِدُوْنَ \nA’ZEEMUT TAAA-EBOONAL A’ABEDOONAL\nsuccess. The repentants, the worshippers, \nالْحَامِدُوْنَ السَّائِحُوْنَ الرَّاكِعُوْنَ \nHAAMEDOONAS SAAA-EHOONAR RAAKE-O’ONAS\nthe glorifiers, those who observe fast, those who bow, \nالسَّاجِدُوْنَ الْاٰمِرُوْنَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ \nSAAJEDOONAL AAMEROONA BIL MA’ROOFE\nthose who prostrate, those who enjoin good \nوَالنَّاهُوْنَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ وَ الْحَافِظُوْنَ \nWANNAAHOONA A’NIL MUNKARE WAL HAAFEZOONA\nand forbid evil and those who observe \nلِحُدُوْدِ اﷲِ وَ بَشِّرِالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nLEHODOODIL LAAHE WA BASH-SHERIL MOMINEENA\nthe limits set by Allah and give glad tidings to the believers.\"\nاَشْهَدُ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ اَنَّ الشَّآكَّ \nASH-HADO YA AMEERAL MOMINEENA ANNASH SHAAKKA\nI bear witness, O leader of the faithful, that he \nفِیْكَ مَا اٰمَنَ بِالرَّسُوْلِ الْاَمِیْنِ وَ اَنَّ \nFEEKA MAA AAMANA BIR RASOOLIL AMEENE WA ANNAL\ndoes not believe in the trustworthy Apostle who has \nالْعَادِلَ بِكَ غَیْرِكَ عَانِدٌ عَنِ الدِّیْنِ \nAADELA BEKA GHAIRAKA A’ANEDUN A’NID DEENIL\nscepticism concerning you that is an enemy of the upright \nالْقَوِیْمِ الَّذِیْ ارْتَضَاهُ لَنَا رَبُّ \nQAWEEMIL LAZEER TAZAAHO LANAA RABBUL\nreligion who has equated someone else with you, the religion with which the Lord \nالْعَالَمِیْنَ وَ اَكْمَلَهٗ بِوِلاَیَتِكَ یَوْمَ \nA’ALAMEENA WA AKMALAHU BE WELAAYATEKA YAWMAL\nof the universe has chosen for us and which He has perfected by your mastership on the \nالْغَدِیْرِ وَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْمَعْنِیُّ بِقَوْلِ \nGHADEERE WA ASH-HADO ANNAKAL MA’NIYYO BEQAWLIL\nDay of Ghadeer and I bear witness that you are the one meant in the following verse \nالْعَزِیْزِ الرَّحِیْمِ وَ اَنَّ هٰذَا صِرَاطِیْ \nA’ZEEZIR RAHEEME WA ANNA HAAZA SERAATI\nof the Honoured the Merciful (Allah): And that this is My straight path, \nمُسْتَقِیْمًا فَاتَّبِعُوْهُ وَلاَ تَتَّبِعُوْا السُّبُلَ \nMUSTAQEEMAN FATTABE-O’O-HO WA LAA TATTABE-O’OS SOBOLA\nthen follow it and do not follow  other paths \nفَتَفَرَّقَ بِكُمْ عَنْ سَبِیْلِهٖ ضَلَّ وَاﷲِ وَ \nFA TAFRRAQA BEKUM A’N SABEELEHI ZALLA WALLAAHE WA\nthen it will deviate you from the path of Allah. I swear by Allah \nاَضَلَّ مَنِ التَّبَعَ سِوَاكَ وَ عِنْدَ عَنِ \nAZALLA MANIT TABA-A’ SEWAAKA WA I’NDA A’NIL\nthat he is deviated and hedeviates others who follows anybody other than you, and that he is an enemy \nالْحَقِّ مَنْ عَادَاكَ \nHAQQE MAN A’ADAKA\nof the truth who opposes you.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ سَمِعْنَا لِاَمْرِكَ وَ اَطَعْنَا وَاتَّبَعْنَا \nALLAAHUMMA SAMEA’NAA LE AMREKA WA ATA’NAA WAT TABA’NAA\nO Allah! we have heard your command and we have obeyed and we have followed \nصِرَاطَكَ الْمُسْتَقِیْمَ فَاهْدِنَا رَبَّنَا وَلاَ \nSERAATAKAL MUSTAQEEMA FAHDENAA RABBANAA WALAA\nyour straight path, then O our Lord, do guide us and \nتُزِغْ قُلُوْبَنَا بَعْدَ اِذْ هَدَیْتَنَا اِلٰی \nTOZIGH QOLOOBANAA BA’DA IZ HADAYTANAA ELAA\ndo not deviate our hearts after you have guided us \nطَاعَتِكَ وَاجْعَلْنَا مِنَ الشَّاكِرِیْنَ لِاَنْعُمِكَ \nTAA-A’TEKA WAJ-A’LNAA MENASH SHAAKEREENA LE-ANO’MEKA\ntowards Your obedience. And include us from those who are thankful for Your bounties,\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ لَمْ تَزَلْ لِلْهَوٰی مُخَالِفًا \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA LAM TAZAL LILHAWAA MOKHAALEFAN\nand I bear witness that You always opposed vain \nوَ لِلتُّقٰی مُحَالِفًا وَ عَلٰی كَظْمِ الْغَیْظِ \nWA LIT-TOQAA MOHAALEFAN WA A’LAA KAZ-MIL GHAYZE\nentertainment and you always exhorted piety \nقَادِرًا وَ عَنِ النَّاسِ عَافِیًا غَافِرًا وَ اِذَا \nQAADERAN WA A’NIN NAASE A’AFEYAN GHAAFERAN WA EZAA\nand you were able to curb the anger and you were forgiving towards the people \nعُصِیَ اﷲُ سَاخِطًا وَ اِذَا اُطِیْعَ اﷲُ \nO’OSEYALLAAHO SAAKHETAN WA EZA OTEEA’LLAAHO\nand you were angry whenever Allah is disobeyed and \nرَاضِیًا وَبِمَا عَهِدَ اِلَیْكَ عَامِلاً رَاعِیًا \nRAAZEYAN WA BEMAA A’HEDA ELAYKA A’AMELAN RAA-E’YAN\nyou were satisfied whenever Allah was obeyed and you acted upon \nلِمَا اسْتُحْفِظْتَ حَافِظًا لِمَا \nLEMAS TOHFIZTA HAAFEZAN LEMAS\nthe covenant of Allah and observed it and you protected the trust when\nاسْتُودِعْتَ مُبَلِّغًا  مَا حُمِّلْتَ مُنْتَظِرًا مَا وُعِدْتَ \nTOODE’TA MOBALLEGHAN MAA HUMMILTA MUNTAZERAN MAA WO-ID-TA\nit was deposited with you and you conveyed whatever was entrusted to you. And you awaited what was promised to you.\nوَ اَشْهَدْ اَنَّكَ مَا اتَّقَیْتَ ضَارِعًا وَلاَ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA MATTAQAYTO ZAARE-A’N WALAA\nAnd I bear witness that you did not fear (your enemy) due to disgrace and\nاَمْسَكْتَ عَنْ حَقِّكَ جَازِعًا وَلاَ \nAMSAKTA A’N HAQQEKA JAAZE-A’N WALAA\nneither did you desist from your right out of helplessness \nاَحْجَمْتَ عَنْ مُجَاهَدَۃِ غَاصِبِیْكَ \nAHJAMTA A’N MOJAAHADATE GHAASEBEEKA\nnor did you avoid fighting against the usurpers out of cowardice \nنَاكِلاً ولاَ اَظْهَرْتَ الرِّضیٰ بِخِلاَفِ \nNAAKELAN WALAA AZHARTAR REZAA BEKHELAAFE\nnor did you express satisfaction in contrary to \nمَا یُرْضِی اﷲَ مُدَاهِنًا وَلاَ وَهَنْتَ لِمَا \nMAA YURZILLAAHA MODAAHENAN WALAA WAHANTA LEMAA\nwhat Allah is satisfied with out of flattery and you did not become disgraced or weak on account of \nاَصَابَكَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ اﷲِ وَلاَ ضَعُفْتَ \nASAABEKA FEE SABEELILLAAHE WALA ZA-O’FAT\nthe tribulations that afflicted you in the way of Allah and \nوَلاَ اسْتَكَنْتَ عَنْ طَلَبِ حَقِّكَ \nWALAS TAKANTA A’N TALABE HAQQEKA\nneither did you observe weakness or slackness in the seeking of your right out of fear.\nمُرَاقِبًا مَعَاذَ اﷲِ اَنْ تَكُوْنَ كَذَالِكَ \nMORAAQEBAN MA’AZALLAAHE AN TAKOONA KAZAALEKA\nI seek protection in Allah that it be like that. Rather, it was like this \nبَلْ اِذْ ظُلِمْتَ اَحْتَسَبْتَ رَبَّكَ وَ \nBAL IZ ZO-LIMTA AHTASABTA RABBAKA WA\nthat whenever you were oppressed, you took into account (the satisfaction of) your Lord and \nفَوَّضْتَ اِلَیْهِ اَمْرَكَ وَ ذَكَّرْتَهُمْ فَمَا \nFAWWAZTA ELAYHE AMRAKA WA ZAKKARTAHUM FAMAZ\nyou entrusted your affair to Him and you adviced them but they \nاذَّكَرُوْا وَ وَعَظْتَهُمْ فَمَا اتَّعَظُوْا \nZAKKARAOO WA WA-A’ZTAHUM FAMAT TA-A’ZOO\nignored it and you admonished them but they did not pay heed to it and \nوَ خَوَّفْتَهُمُ اﷲَ فَمَا تَخَوَّفُوْا \nWA KHAWWAFTAHOMULLAAHA FAMAA TAKHAWWAFOO\nyou tried to imbibe fear of Allah in them but they remain unaffected \nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA YA AMEERAL MOMINEENA\nand I bear witness that you, O the commander of the faithful, \nجَاهَدْتَ فِیْ اﷲِ حَقَّ جِهَادِهٖ حَتّٰی \nJAAHADTA FILLAAHE HAQQA JEHAADEHI HATTAA\nyou fought in the way of Allah as it ought to be \nدَعَاكَ اﷲُ اِلٰی جِوَارِهٖ وَ قَبَضَكَ اِلَیْهِ \nDA-A’AKALLAAHO ELAA JEWAAREHI WA QABAZAKA ILAYHE\ntill the time Allah called you in His precints and He \nبِاِخْتِیَارِهٖ وَ اَلْزَمَ اَعْدَآئَكَ الْحُجَّۃَ \nBE IKHTEYAAREHI WA ALZAMA A’ADAAA-EKAL HUJJATA\ncaptured your soul by His choice and made incumbent His argument \nبِقَتْلِهِمْ اِیَّاكَ لِتَكُوْنَ الْحُجَّۃُ لَكَ \nBE QATLEHIM IYYAAKA LE TAKOONAL HUJJATO LAKA\nagainst your enemies by their killing you \nعَلَیْهِمْ مَعَ مَا لَكَ مِنَ الْحُجَجِ \nA’LAYHIM MA-A’ MAALAKA MENAL HOJAJIL\nso that it can be an argument for you against \nالْبَالِغَۃِ عَلٰی جَمِیْعِ خَلْقِهٖ\nBAALEGHATE A’LAA JAMEE-E’ KHALQEHI\nthem from the decisive arguments upon all the creation.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA AMEERAL MOMINEENA\nPeace be on you, O the commander of the faithful, \nعَبَدْتَ اﷲَ مُخْلِصًا وَ جَاهَدْتَ \nA’BADTALLAAHAA MUKHLESAN WA JAAHADTA\nyou worshipped Allah sincerely and fought in the \nفِی اﷲِ صَابِراً وَ جُدْتَ بِنَفْسِكَ \nFEELLAAE SAABERAN WA JUDTA BENAFSEKA\nway of Allah with patience and sacrificed your life \nمُحْتَسِباً وَ عَمِلْتَ بِكِتَابِهٖ وَاتَّبَعْتَ \nMOHTASEBAN WA A’MILTA BE KETAABEHI WATTABA’TA\nby the order of Allah and you acted upon His Book and followed the \nسُنَّۃَ نَبِیِّهٖ وَ اَقَمْتَ الصَّلٰوۃَ وَ اٰتَیْتَ \nSUNNATA NABIYYEHI WA AQAMTAS SALAATA WA AATAYTAZ\ntraditions of His Prophet and you established the prayer and gave \nالزَّكٰوۃَ وَ اَمَرْتَ بِالْمَعْرُوْفِ \nZAKAATA WA AMARTA BIL MA’ROOFE\nthe poor-due and enjoined the good \nوَ نَهَیْتَ عَنِ الْمُنْكَرِ مَا اسْتَطَعْتَ \nWA NAHAYTA A’NIL MUNKARE MAS TATA’TA\nand forbade the evil as much as you could and you sought the \nمُبْتَغِیًا مَا عِنْدَ اﷲِ رَاغِبًا فِیْمَا وَعَدَ \nMUBTAGHEYAN MA I’NDALLAAHE RAAGHEBAN FEEMAA WA-A’DAL\nsatisfaction of Allah and you yearned for the Promise \nاﷲُ لاَ تَحْفِلُ بِالنَّوَآئِبِ وَلاَ تَهِنُ \nLAAHO LAA TAHFELO BINNAWAAA-EBE WALAA TAHENO\nof Allah.You did not express cowardice in the \nعِنْدَ الشَّدَآئِدِ وَلاَ تُحْجِمُ عَنْ \nI’NDASH SHADAAA-EDE WALAA TOHJEMO A’N\nface of difficulties neither did you feel disgrace in tribulation nor did you make a retreat \nمُحَارِبٍ اَفَكَ مَنْ نَسَبَ غَیْرَ ذٰلِكَ \nMOHAAREBIN AFAKA MAN NASABA GHAYRA ZAALEKA\nfrom any battle. Anyone who says contrary to this has certainly lied and has \nاِلَیْكَ وَافْتَرٰی بَاطِلاً عَلَیْكَ وَ اَوْلٰی \nELAYKA WAFTARAA BAATELAN A’LAYKA WA AWLAA\nascribed falsehood to you and he certainly perished who intentionally opposed you.\nلِمَنْ عِنْدَ عَنْكَ لَقَدْ جَاهَدْتَ فِی اﷲِ \nLEMAN I’NDA A’NKA LAQAD JAAHADTA FEELLAAHE\nCertainly you fought in the way of Allah \nحَقَّ الْجِهَادِ وَ صَبَرْتَ عَلَی الْاَذٰی \nHAQQAL JEHAADE WA SABARTA A’LAL AZAA\nas it ought to be and you exhibited the patience \nصَبْرَ احْتِسَابٍ وَ اَنْتَ اَوَّلُ مَنْ اٰمَنَ \nSABRAH TESAABIN WA ANTA AWWALO MAN AAMANA\nof an expectant person in the face of troubles and tortures while you were the first to believe \nبِاﷲِ وَ صَلّٰی لَهٗ وَ جَاهَدَ وَ اَبْدٰی \nBILLAAHE WA SALLAA LAHU WA JAAHADA WA ABADAA\nin Allah and pray to Him and fight in His way. You manifested openly \nصَفْحَتَهٗ فِیْ دَارِ الشِّرْكِ وَالْاَرْضُ \nSAFHATAHU FEE DAARISH SHIRKE WAL ARZO\nin the land of polytheism while the earth \nمَشْحُوْنَۃٌ ضَلاَلَۃً وَالشَّیْطَانُ یُعْبَدُ \nMASH HOONATUN ZALAALATAN WASH SHAYTAANO YO’BADO\nwas full of deviation and the Devil was worshipped \nجَهْرَۃً وَ اَنْتَ الْقَآئِلُ لاَ تَزِیْدُنِیْ \nJAH-RATAN WA ANTAL QAAA-ELO LAA TAZEEDONEE\nopenly and you used to say that the multitude \nكَثْرَۃُ النَّاسِ حَوْلِیْ عِزَّۃً وَلاَ تَفَرُّقُهُمْ \nKASRATUN NAASE HAWLEE I’ZZATAN WALAA TAFARROQOHUM\nof people around me will not increase my honour nor will their dispersion from me \nعَنِّیْ وَحْشَۃً وَلَوْ اَسْلَمَنِی النَّاسُ \nA’NNEE WAHSHATAN WA LAW ASLAMANIN NAASO\ncause me forloneness and if all the people would have submitted to me,\nجَمِیْعًا لَمْ اَكُنْ مُتَضَرِّعًا اِعْتَصَمْتَ \nJAMEEA’N LAM AKUN MOTAZARREA’N I-A’TASAMTA\nI would not become humble (to them) You have clung \nبِاﷲِ فَعَزَزْتَ وَ اٰثَرْتَ الْاٰخِرَۃَ \nBILLAAHE FA A’ZAZTA WA AASARTAL AAKHERATA\nunto Allah then He has granted you honour and you preferred the hereafter to this world \nعَلَی الْاُوْلٰی فَزَهِدْتَ وَ اَیَّدَكَ اﷲُ \nA’LAL OOLAA FAZAHEDAT WA AYYADAKALLAAHO\nso you exhibited abstinence and Allah assisted you \nوَ هَدَاكَ وَ اَخْلَصَكَ وَ اجْتَبٰیكَ \nWA HADAAKA WA AKHLASAKA WAJ TABAAKA\nand guided you and made you devoted and chose you, \nفَمَا تَنَاقَضَتْ اَفْعَالُكَ وَ لاَ اخْتَلَفَتْ \nFAMAA TANAAQAZAT AF-A’ALOKA WALAKH TALAFAT\nthus there was no discrepancy in your actions and no contradiction\nاَقْوَالُكَ وَ لاَ تَقَلَّبَتْ اَحْوَالُكَ وَ لاَ \nAQWAALOKA WALA TAQALLABAT AHWAALOKA WALAD\nin your sayings and no alteration in your conditions.\nادَّعَیْتَ وَلاَ افْتَرَیْتَ عَلَی اﷲِ كَذِباً \nDA-A’YTA WALAAF TARAYTA A’LALLAAHE KAZEBAN\nYou did not claim nor lied against Allah \nوَلاَ شَرِهْتَ اِلَی الْحُطَامِ وَ لاَ \nWALAA SHAREH-TA ELAL HOTAAME WALAA\nand were not greedy for the wealth of this world and neither \nدَنَّسَكَ الْاٰثَامُ وَلَمْ تَزَلْ عَلٰی بَیِّنَۃٍ \nDANNASAKAL AASAAMO WALAM TAZAL A’LAA BAYYENATIN\ndid sins pollute you and you always remained on the Proof \nمِنْ رَبِّكَ وَ یَقِیْنٍ مِنْ اَمْرِكَ تَهْدِیْ \nMIN RABBEKA WA YAQEENIN MIN AMREKA TAHDEE\nfrom your Lord and certitude regarding your affair. \nاِلَی الْحَقِّ وَ اِلٰی صِرَاطٍ مُسْتَقِیْمٍ \nELAL HAQQE WA ELAA SERAATIN MUSTAQEEMIN\nYou guided towards the truth and the straight path.\nاَشْهَدُ شَهَادَۃَ حَقٍّ وَ اُقْسِمُ بِاﷲِ \nASH-HADO SAHAADATA HAQQIN WA UKSEMO BILLAAHE\nI bear witness, a rightful witnessing, and a swear by Allah \nقَسَمَ صِدْقٍ اَنَّ مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلَهٗ \nQASAMA SIDQIN ANNA MOHAMMADIN WA AALAHU\nwith a true swear that Mohammad and his progeny \nصَلَوَاتُ اﷲِ عَلَیْهِمْ سَادَاتُ الْخَلْقِ \nSALAWAATULLAHE A’LAYHIM SAADAATUL KHALQE\nare the leaders of the creation \nوَ اَنَّكَ مَوْلاَیَ وَ مَوْلَی الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nWA ANNAKA MAWLAAYA WA MAWLAL MOMINEENA\nand that you are my master and the master of the believers \nوَ اَنَّكَ عَبْدُاﷲِ وَ وَلِیُّهُ وَ اَخُو \nWA ANNAKA A’BDULLAAHE WA WALLIYYOHU WA AKHUR\nand that you are the servant of Allah and His friend and the brother \nالرَّسُوْلِ وَ وَصِیُّهٗ وَ وَارِثُهٗ وَ اَنَّهٗ \nRASOOLE WA WASEEYOHU WA WAARESOHU WA ANNAHUL\nof the Apostle and his vicegerent and his inheritor and that he \nالْقَآئِلُ لَكَ وَالَّذِیْ بَعَثَنِیْ بِالْحَقِّ مَا \nQAAA-ELO LAKA WALLAZEE BA-A’SANEE BIL HAQQE MAA\nsaid to you:I swear by the \nاٰمَنَ بِیْ مَنْ كَفَرَ بِكَ وَلاَ اَقَرَّ \nAAMANA BEE MAN KAFARA BEKA WALAA AQARRA\nOne Who has raised me with the truth, he does not believe in me who denies you and he does not affirm \nبِاﷲِ مَنْ جَحَدَكَ وَ قَدْ ضَلَّ مَنْ \nBILLAAHE MAN JAHADAKA WAQAD ZALLA MAN\nin Allah who rejects you and certainly he is deviated \nصَدَّ عَنْكَ وَ لَمْ یَهْتَدِ اِلَی اﷲِ وَلاَ \nSADDA A’NKA WALAM YAHTADE ILALLAAHE WALAA\nwho digresses from you and he is not guided towards Allah and towards \nاِلَیَّ مَنْ لاَ یَهْتَدِیْ بِكَ وَ هُوَ قَوْلُ \nELLAYYA MAN LAAYAHTADEE BEKA WA HOWA QAWLO \nme who is not guided towards you and this is the saying of \nرَبِّیْ عَزَّوَجَلَّ وَ اِنِّیْ لَغَفَّارٌ لِمَنْ تَابَ \nRABBEE A’ZZAWAJALLA WA INNEE LAGHAFFAARUN LEMAN TAABA\nmy Lord, the Honoured, the Majestic. \"And surely I forgive \nوَ اٰمَنَ وَ عَمِلَ صَالِحًا ثُمَّ اهْتَدٰی \nWA AAMANA WA A’MELA SAALEHAN SUMMAH TADAA\nthose who repent and believe and do good and then he is guided\"\nاِلٰی وِلاَیَتِكَ مَوْلاَیَ فَضْلُكَ لاَ \nELAA WELAAYATEKA MAWLAAYA FAZLOKA LAA \ntowards your mastership. O my master, your excellence \nیَخْفٰی وَ نُوْرُكَ لاَ یُطْفَأُ وَ اَنَّ مَنْ \nYAKHFAA WA NOOROKA LAA YUTFA-O WA ANNA MAN\ncannot be concealed and your light cannot be extinguished and the one \nجَحَدَكَ الظَّلُوْمُ الْاَشْقٰی \nJAHADAKAZ ZALOOMUL ASHQAA\nwho denies you is an excessive oppressor and the most unfortunate one. \nمَوْلاَیَ اَنْتَ الْحُجَّۃُ عَلَی الْعِبَادِ وَ \nMAWLAAYA ANTAL HUJJATO A’LAL E’BAADE WAL\nO my master, you are the proof upon the servants and the guide \nالْهَادِیْ اِلَی الرَّشَادِ وَالْعُدَّۃُ لِلْمَعَادِ \nHAADEE ELAR RASHAADE WAL U’DDATO LIL MA-A’ADE\ntowards the right course and the support concerning the hereafter. \nمَوْلاَیَ لَقَدْ رَفَعَ اﷲُ فِی الْاُولٰی \nMAULAYA LAQAD RAFA-A’LLAAHO FIL OOLAA\nO my master, surely Allah has raised your status in this world \nمَنْزِلَتَكَ وَ اَعْلٰی فِیْ الْاٰخِرَۃِ \nMANZELATEKA WA A’ALAA FIL AAKHERATE\nand has elevated your grade in the hereafter and has \nدَرَجَتَكَ وَ بَصَّرَكَ مَا عَمِیَ عَلٰی مَنْ \nDARAJATAKA WA BASSARAKA MA A’MEYA A’LAA MAN\nmade you see what your enemies are blind \nخَالَفَكَ وَ حَالَ بَیْنَكَ وَ بَیْنَ مَوَاهِبِ \nKHAALAFAKA WA HAALA BAYNAKA WA BAYNA MAWAAHEBIL\nto and came between you and the bounties of Allah \nاﷲِ لَكَ فَلَعَنَ اﷲُ مُسْتَحِلِّیْ الْحُرْمَۃِ \nLAAHE LAKA FA LA’NALLAAHO MUSTAHILLIL HURMATE\nfor you. Then may Allah curse those who misappropriated your honour \nمِنْكَ وَ ذَآئِدِی الْحَقِّ عَنْكَ \nMINKA WA ZAAA-EDIL HAQQE A’NKA\nand distanced your right from you \nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّهُمُ الْاَخْسَرُوْنَ الَّذِیْنَ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNHOMUL AKHSAROONAL LAZEENA\nand I bear witness that they \nتَلْفَحُ وُجُوْهَهُمُ النَّارُ وَهُمْ فِیْهَا كَالِحُوْنَ \nTALFAHO WOJOOHAHOMUN NAARO WA HUM FEEHA KAALEHOONA\nare the most severe losers, those whose faces will be scorched in Hell-fire and they will gloomily abide therein.\nوَ اَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ مَا اَقْدَمْتَ وَلاَ \nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA MAA AQDAMTA WALAA\nAnd I bear witness that you did not make \nاَحْجَمْتَ وَلاَ نَطَقْتَ وَلاَ اَمْسَكْتَ \nAHJAMTA WALAA NATQ-TA WALAA AMSAKTA\nany endeavour or desisted from anything nor said anything or withheld anything \nاِلاَّ بِاَمْرٍ مِنَ اﷲِ وَ رَسُوْلِهٖ قُلْتَ \nILLAA BE AMRIN MENALLAAHE WA RASOOLEHI QULTA\nexcept by the order of Allah and His Apostle. You said: \nوَالَّذِیْ نَفْسِیْ بِیَدِهٖ لَقَدْ نَظَرَ اِلَیَّ \nWAL LAZEE NAFSEE BEYADEHI LAQAD NAZARA ILAYYA\n\"I swear by the One in Whose hand is my soul \nرَسُوْلُ اﷲِ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ \nRASOOLULLAAHE SALLALLAAHO ALAYHE WA AALEHI\nthat the Apostle of Allah; peace be upon him and his family ,\nاَضْرِبُ السَّیْفَ قُدْمًا فَقَالَ یَا عَلِیُّ \nAZREBO BISSAYFA QUDMAN FAQAALA YAA A’LIYYO \nwas looking at me when I was fighting with the sword in front of him. ‘O Ali! \nاَنْتَ مِنِّیْ بِمَنْزِلَۃِ هَارُوْنَ مِنْ مُوْسٰی \nANTA MINNEE BE MANZELATEHI HAAROONA MIN MOOSA\nYou are to me as Haroon was to Moosa \nاِلاَّ اَنَّهٗ لاَ نَبِیَّ بَعْدِیْ وَ اُعْلِمُكَ اَنَّ \nILLAA ANNAHU LAA NABIYYA BA’DEE WA O’LEMOKA  ANNA\nexcept that there is no Prophet after me and I inform you that \nمَوْتَكَ وَ حَیٰوتَكَ مَعِیْ وَ عَلٰی سُنَّتِیْ \nMAWTAKA WA HAYAATAKA MA-E’E WA A’LAA SUNNATEE\nyour death and your life is with me and on my tradition, \nفَوَ اﷲِ مَا كَذِبْتُ وَلاَ كُذِبْتُ وَلاَ \nFAWALLAAHE MAA KAZIBTO WALAA KOZIBTO WALAA \nthen by Allah, I have never lied nor have even been lied to and neither \nضَلَلْتُ وَلاَ ضُلَّ بِیْ وَلاَ نَسِیْتُ مَا \nZALALTO WALAA ZULLA BEE WALAA NASAYTO MAA\nhave I been deviated nor has anyone been deviated by me and neither have I forgotten \nعَهِدَ اِلَیَّ رَبِّیْ وَ اِنِّیْ لَعَلٰی بَیِّنَۃٍ مِنْ \nA’HEDA ELAYYA RABBEE WA INNEE LA-A’LAA BAYYENATIN MIN\nwhat my Lord has taken as covenant from me and I am on a proof from \nرَبِّیْ بَیَّنَهَا لِنَبِیِّهٖ وَ بَیَّنَهَا النَّبِیُّ لِیْ \nRABBEE BAYYANAHAA LENABIYYEHI WA BAYYANAHAN NABIYYO LEE\nmy Lord which He has explained to His Prophet and the Prophet has in turn explained to me \nوَ اِنِّیْ لَعَلَی الطَّرِیْقِ الْوَاضِحِ اَلْفِظْهُ \nWA INNEE LA-A’TTAREEQIL WAAZEHE ALFEZHO\nand surely I am on a clear path which \nلَفْظًا صَدَقْتَ وَاﷲِ وَ قُلْتَ الْحَقَّ \nLAFZAN SADAQTA WALLAAHE WA QULTAL HAQQA\nI articulate to you. I swear by Allah! You have spoken the truth and have said correctly.\nفَلَعَنَ اﷲُ مَنْ سَاوَاكَ بِمَنْ نَاوَاكَ \nFA LA’NALLAAHO MAN SAAWAAKA BEMAN NAAWAAKA\nThen may Allah curse those who equate your enemies with you \nوَاﷲُ جَلَّ اسْمُهٗ یَقُوْلُ هَلْ یَسْتَوِی \nWALLAAHO JALLAS MOHU YAQOOLO HAL YASTAWIL\nwhile Allah, Honoured be His name, has said: Are those \nالَّذِیْنَ یَعْلَمُوْنَ وَالَّذِیْنَ لاَ یَعْلَمُوْنَ \nLAZEENA YA’LAMOONA WAL LAZEENA LAA YA’LAMOONA\nwho know equal to those who don’t?\nفَلَعَنَ اﷲُ مَنْ عَدَلَ بِكَ مَنْ فَرَضَ \nFA LA’NALLAAHO MAN A’DALA BEKA MAN FARAZAL\nThen curse of Allah be upon the one who has equated with you the one on whom \nاﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وِلاَیَتَكَ وَ اَنْتَ وَلِیُّ اﷲِ \nLAAHO A’LAYHE WELAAYATAKA WA ANTA WALIYULLAAHE\nyour mastership has been made obligatory and you are the friend of Allah \nوَ اَخُوْ رَسُوْلِهٖ وَالذَّآبُّ عَنْ دِیْنِهٖ \nWA AKHOO RASOOLEHI WAZ-ZAAAB-BO A’N DEENEHI\nand the brother of His Apostle and the defender of His religion \nوَالَّذِیْ نَطَقَ الْقُرْاٰنُ بِتَفْضِیْلِهٖ \nWAL LAZEE NATAQAL QUR-AANO BE TAFZEELEHI\nand the one whose virtues have been extolled by the Quran. \nقَالَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی وَ فَضَّلَ اﷲُ \nQAALALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA WA FAZZALLALLAAHUL\nAllah, the High, has said. \"And Allah has excelled the warriors \nالْمُجَاهِدِیْنَ عَلَی الْقَاعِدِیْنَ اَجْراً \nMOJAAHEDEENA A’LAL QAA-E’DEENA AJRAN\nover the sitting ones with a great \nعَظِیْمًا دَرَجَاتٍ مِنْهُ وَ مَغْفِرَۃً \nA’ZEEMAN DARAJAATIN MINHO WA MAGHFERATAN\nreward and grades, forgiveness and \nوَ رَحْمَۃً وَ كَانَ اﷲُ غَفُوْراً رَحِیْمًا \nWA RAHMATAN WA KAANALLAAHO GHAFOORAN RAHEEMAN\nmercy from His side and Allah is forgiving, merciful \nوَ قَالَ اﷲُ تَعَالیٰ اَجَعَلْتُمْ سِقَایَۃَ \nWA QAALALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA AJA-A’LTUM SEQAAYATAL\nand Allah, the Elevated, has said: Do you consider the one who provides \nالْحَآجِّ وَ عِمَارَۃَ الْمَسْجِدِ الْحَرَامِ \nHAAJJE WA E’MAARATAL MASJEDIL HARAAME\nwater to the pilgrims and the one who constructs the Sacred Mosque, \nكَمَنْ اٰمَنَ بِاﷲِ وَالْیَوْمِ الْاٰخِرِ وَ \nKAMAN AAMANA BILLAAHE WAL YAWMIL AAKHERE WA\nequal to the one who believes in Allah and the Last Day and \nجَاهَدَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ اﷲِ لاَ یَسْتَوْنَ عِنْدَ \nJAAHADA FEE SABEELILLAAHE LAA YASTAWNA I’NDAL\nfights in the way of Allah, they are not equal near \nاﷲِ وَاﷲُ لاَ یَهْدِی الْقَوْمَ الظَّالِمِیْنَ \nLAAHE WALLAAHO LAA YAHDEEL QAWMAZ ZAALEMEENAL\nAllah and Allah does not guide the oppressive people.\nالَّذِیْنَ آمَنُوْا وَ هَاجَرُوْا وَ جَاهَدُوْا \nLAZEENA  A AAMANOO WA HAAJAROO WA JAAHADOO \nThose who believed and migrated and fought \nفِیْ سَبِیْلِ اﷲِ بِاَمْوَالِهِمْ وَ اَنْفُسِهِمْ \nFEE SABEELILLAAHE BE AMWAALEHIM WA ANFOSEHIM \nin the way of Allah with their wealth and lives, \nاَعْظَمُ دَرَجَۃً عِنْدَ اﷲِ وَ اُولٰٓئِكَ هُمُ \nA-A’ZAMO DARAJATAN I’NDALLAAHE WA OOLAAA-EKA HOMUL\nthey will have an esteemed status near Allah and they will be the \nالْفَآئِزُوْنَ یُبَشِّرُهُمْ رَبُّهُمْ بِرَحْمَۃٍ مِنْهُ  \nFAAA-EZOONA YOBASH SHEROHUM RABBOHUM BERAHMATIN MINHO\nsuccessful ones. Their Lord gives them the glad tidings of mercy from Him \nوَرِضْوَانٍ وَ جَنَّاتٍ فِیْهَا نَعِیْمٌ مُقِیْمٌ \nWARIZWAANIN WA JANNAATIN FEEHA NA-E’EMUN MOQEEMUN\nand satisfaction and the gardens in which are everlasting bounties, abiding \nخَالِدِیْنَ فِیْهَآ اَبَدًا اِنَّ اﷲَ عِنْدَهٗ اَجْرٌ عَظِیْمٌ \nKHAALEDEENA FEEHA ABADAN INNALLAAHA I’NDAHU AJRUN A’ZEEMUN\ntherein forever. Surely, near Allah is a great reward (for them). \nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ الْمَخْصُوصُ بِمِدْحَۃِ \nASH-HADO ANNAKAL MAKHSOOSO BE MIDHATIL\nI bear witness that you have been particularized for the Praise \nاﷲِ الْمُخْلِصُ لِطَاعَۃِ اﷲِ لَمْ تَبْغِ \nLAAHEIL MUKHLESO LETAA-A’TILLAAHE LAM TABGHE\nof Allah, the sincere one in the obedience of Allah, you did not desire anything in exchange \nبِالْهُدیٰ بَدَلاً وَ لَمْ تُشْرِكْ بِعِبَادَۃِ \nBIL HODAA BADALAN WALAM TUSHRIK BE E’BAADATE\nof guidance and did not associate anybody in the worship \nرَبِّكَ اَحَدًا وَ اَنَّ اﷲَ تَعَالَی اسْتَجَابَ \nRABBEKA AHADAN WA ANNALLAAHA TA-A’ALAS TAJAABA\nof Your Lord. And that Allah accepted the forgiveness of \nلِنَبِیِّهٖ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ فِیْكَ \nLENABEEYEHI SALLALLAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI FEEKA\nHis Prophet, blessings of Allah be upon him and his progeny, concerning you \nدَعْوَتَهٗ ثُمَّ اَمَرَهٗ بِاِظْهَارِ مَا اَوْلاَكَ \nDA’WATAHU SUMMA AMARAHU BE IZHAARE MAA AWLAAKA\nand then He ordered him to make public your mastership \nلِاُمَّتِهٖ اِعْلآٰئً لِشَاْنِكَ وَ اِعْلاَنًا \nLE UMMATEHI EA’LAAA-AN LE SHAANEKA WA EA’LAANAN\nin his nation, as an elevation of your status and an announcement \nلِبُرْهَانِكَ وَدَحْضًا لِلْاَبَاطِیْلِ وَ قَطْعًا \nLE BURHAANEKA WA DAHZAN LILABAATEELE WAQAT-A’N\nfor your proof and a demolition of falsehood \nلِلْمَعَّاذِیْرِ فَلَمَّا اَشْفَقَ مِنْ فِتْنَۃِ \nLILMA-A’A-ZEERE FALAMMAA ASHFAQA MIN FITNATIL\nand to cut out the made-up excuses. Then when he feared the mischief \nالْفَاسِقِیْنَ وَاتَّقٰی فِیْكَ الْمُنَافِقِیْنَ \nFAASEQEENA WATTAQAA FEEKAL MONAAFEQEENA\nof the transgressors and was apprehensive for you about the hypocrites, \nاَوْحیٰ اِلَیْهِ رَبُّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ \nAWHAA ELAYHE RABBUL A’ALAMEENA\nthe Lord of the Universe revealed unto him, \nیَآ اَیُّهَا الرَّسُوْلُ بَلِّغْ مَآ اُنْزِلَ اِلَیْكَ \nYAA AYYOHARRASOOLO BALLIGH MAA UNZELA ELAYKA\n\"O Apostle! Convey what has come down to you from \nمِنْ رَبِّكَ وَ اِنْ لَمْ تَفْعَلْ فَمَا بَلَّغْتَ \nMIN RABBEKA WA IN LAM TAF-A’L FAMAA BALLAGHTA\nyour Lord and if you do it not, then you have not conveyed \nرِسَالَتَهٗ وَاﷲُ یَعْصِمُكَ مِنَ النَّاسِ \nRESAALATAHU WALLAAHO YA’SEMOKA MENANNAASE\nthe message and Allah will protect you from the people.\nفَوَضَعَ عَلٰی نَفْسِهٖ اَوْزَارَ الْمَسِیْرِ \nFAWAZA-A’ A’LAA NAFSEHI AWZAARAL MASEERE\nThen he took upon him the burden of travelling \nوَ نَهَضَ فِیْ رَمْضَآئِ الْهَجِیْرِ \nWA NAHAZA FEE RAMZAAA-ILHAJEERA\nand in the daunting heat of noon, \nفَخَطَبَ وَ اَسْمَعَ وَ نَادٰی فَاَبْلَغَ ثُمَّ \nFA KHATABA WA ASMA-A’ WA NAADAA FA ABLAGHA SUMMA\nthen he delivered a sermon audible to the people, and conveyed the message to them. \nسَئَلَهُمْ اَجْمَعَ فَقَالَ هَلْ بَلَّغْتُ \nSA-ALAHUM AJMA-A’ FAQAALA HAL BALLAGHTO\nThen he asked them all, Have I conveyed the message?\nفَقَالُوا اللّٰهُمَّ بَلٰی فَقَالَ اللّٰهُمَّ \nFAQAALOO ALLAAHUMMA BALAA FAQAALALLAAHUMMASH\nThey replied, ‘Yes, by Allah! He then said, ‘O Allah! \nاشْهَدْ ثُمَّ قَالَ اَلَسْتُ اَوْلٰی \nHAD SUMMA QAALA ALASTO AWLAA\nYou bear witness. Then he said, \"Am I not having \nبِالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ مِنْ اَنْفُسِهِمْ فَقَالُوْا بَلٰی \nBIL MOMINEENA MIN ANFOSEHIM FAQAALOO\nmore authority over the believers then they have on their ownselves?’ They replied, ‘Yes.’\nفَاَخَذَ بِیَدِكَ وَ قَالَ مَنْ كُنْتُ مَوْلاَهُ \nFAAKHZA BEYADEKA WAQAALAMAN KUNTO MAULAAHO\nThen he held your hand and said, ‘Of whomsoever I am the Master, \nفَهٰذَا عَلِیٌّ مَوْلاَهُ اَللّٰهُمَّ وَالِ مَنْ \nFAHAAZA ALIYUN MAULAAHO ALLAAHUMMA WAALE MAN\nthis Ali is his master. O Allah! You befriend \nوَالاَهُ وَ عَادِ مَنْ عَادَاهُ وَانْصُرْ مَنْ \nWALAAHO WA’’ade MAN AADAAHO WA ANSUR MAN\nhim who befriends Ali and You bear enmity with the one who bears enmity with Ali and You help him who \nنَصَرَهٗ وَاخْذُلْ مَنْ خَذَلَهٗ فَمَا اٰمَنَ \nNASRARAHU WA AKHZUL MAN KHAZALAHU FAMAA AMANA\nhelps Ali and You forsake the one who forsakes Ali. Then none believed \nبِمَا اَنْزَلَ اﷲُ فِیْكَ عَلٰی نَبِیِّهٖ اِلاَّ \nBEMA ANZALA LLAAHO FEEKA A’LAA NABEEYEHI ILLA\nin what Allah sent down upon His Apostle \nقَلِیْلٌ وَلاَ زَادَ اَكْثَرَهُمْ غَیْرَ تَخْسِیْرٍ \nQALEELUN WALA ZAADA AKSARAHUM GHAIRA TAKHSEERIN\nconcerning you except a few and the majority of them gained nothing but loss \nوَ لَقَدْ اَنْزَلَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی فِیْكَ مِنْ \nWALAQAD ANZALLALLAH TA’ALAA FEEKA MIN\nwhile surely Allah has send down verses concerning \nقَبْلُ وَهُمْ كَارِهُوْنَ یَآ اَیُّهَا الَّذِیْنَ \nQABLOWA HUM KAAREHOONA YA AYYOHAL LAZEENA\nyou previously while they were averse to it: \"O you who \nاٰمَنُوْا مَنْ یَّرْتَدَّ مِنْكُمْ عَنْ دِیْنِهٖ \nAAMANOO MAN YARTADDA MINKUM ‘ANDEENEHI\nbelieve! Whomsoever of you who turns away from his religion, \nفَسَوْفَ یَاْتِیْ اﷲُ بِقَوْمٍ یُحِبُّهُمْ \nFASAWFA YA YAATILLAAHO BE QAWMIN YOHIBBOHUM\n(he will not harm Allah in any way) for then surely Allah will bring forth a group whom He will love \nوَ یُحِبُّوْنَهٗ اَذِلَّۃٍ عَلَی الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ اَعِزَّۃٍ \nWA YOHIBBOONAHU AZILLATIN A’LAL MOMINEENA A-I’ZZATIN\nand they will love Him. They will be humble before the believers and very severe \nعَلَی الْكَافِرِیْنَ یُجَاهِدُوْنَ فِیْ سَبِیْلِ \nA’LAL KAAFEREENA YOJAAHEDOONA FEE SABEELIL\nupon the disbelievers. They will fight in the way of \nاﷲِ وَلاَ یَخَافُوْنَ لَوْمَۃَ لاآئِمٍ \nLAAHE WALAA YAKHAAFOONA LAWMATA LAAA-EMIN\nAllah and will not fear the slandering of any slanderer (in the way of Allah).\nذٰلِكَ فَضْلُ اﷲِ یُؤْتِیْهِ مَنْ یَشَّآئُ \nZAALEKA FAZLULLAAHE YO’TEEHI MAN YASHAAA-O\nThat is the Grace of Allah, He grants it to whomsoever \nوَاﷲُ وَاسِعٌ عَلِیْمٌ اِنَّمَا وَلِیُّكُمُ اﷲُ \nWALLAAHO WAASE-U’N ALEEMUN INNAMAA WALEEYOKOMULLAAHO\nHe wishes. And Allah is Abundant, All Knowing. Surely, your Guardian is Allah \nوَ رَسُوْلُهٗ وَالَّذِیْنَ اٰمَنُوْا الَّذِیْنَ \nWA RASOOLOHU WALLAZEENA AAAMANUL LAZEENA\nand His Apostle and those who \nیُقِیْمُوْنَ الصَّلٰوۃَ وَ یُؤْتُوْنَ الزَّكٰوۃَ \nYOQEEMOONASSALAATA WA YOA-TOONAZ ZAKAATA\nestablish prayer and offer poor-due \nوَهُمْ رَاكِعُوْنَ وَ مَنْ یَتَوَلَّ اﷲَ \nWA HUM RAAKEO’ONA WA MAN YATAWWALALLAAHA\nwhile they are bowing and whomsoever takes Allah \nوَ رَسُوْلَهٗ وَالَّذِیْنَ اٰمَنُوْا فَاِنَّ حِزْبَ \nWA RASOOLAHU WAL LAZEENA AAAMANU FA-INNA HIZBAL\nand His Apostle and those who believe as guardian, then surely the group of \nاﷲِ هُمُ الْغَالِبُوْنَ رَبَّنَا اٰمَنَّا بِمَا \nLAAHE HOMUL GHAALEBOONA RABBANAA AAMANNA BEMAA\nAllah will be successful. O Allah! We believe in what \nاَنْزَلْتَ وَ اتَّبَعْنَا الرَّسُوْلَ فَاكْتُبْنَا مَعَ \nANZALTA WATTABA’NAR RASOOLA FAKTUBNAA MA-A’SH\nYou have revealed and we followed the Prophet, then include us among \nالشَّاهِدِیْنَ رَبَّنَا لاَ تُزِغْ قُلُوْبَنَا بَعْدَ \nSHAAHEDEENA RABBANAA LAA TOZIGH QOLOOBANA BA’DA\nthe witnesses. O Our Lord, do not deviate our hearts after You \nاِذْ هَدَیْتَنَا وَ هَبْ لَنَا مِنْ لَدُنْكَ \nIZ HADAYTANAA WAHAB LANAA MIN LADUNKA\nhave guided us and grant us \nرَحْمَۃً اِنَّكَ اَنْتَ الْوَهَّابُ \nRAHMATAN INNAKA ANTAL WAHHAABO\nMercy from Your side, Surely You are the Abundant Giver.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنَّا نَعْلَمُ اَنَّ هٰذَا هُوَ الْحَقُّ مِنْ \nALLAAHUMMA INNAA NA’LAMO ANNA HAAZAA HWAL HAQQO MIN \nO Allah, we know that this is the truth from \nعِنْدِكَ فَالْعَنْ مَنْ عَارَضَهٗ وَاسْتَكْبَرَ \nI’NDEKA FAL-A’N MAN A’ARAZAHU WASTAKBARA\nYour side then curse those who oppose it and exhibit haughtiness concerning it \nوَ كَذَّبَ بِهٖ وَ كَفَرَ وَ سَیَعْلَمُ الَّذِیْنَ \nWA KAZZABA BEHI WA KAFARA WA SAYA’LAMUL LAZEENA\nand reject it and disbelieve in it and soon \nظَلَمُوْا اَیَّ مُنْقَلَبٍ یَنْقَلِبُونَ \nZALAMOO AYYA MUNQALABIN YANQALEBOONA\nthe oppressors shall know where they will be transferred to.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ \nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YA AMEERAL MOMINEENA\nPeace be on you, O the leader of the faithful \nوَ سَیِّدَ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ وَ اَوَّلَ الْعَابِدِیْنَ \nWA SAYYEDAL WASEEYYEENA WA AWWALAL A’ABEDEENA\nand the chief of the vicegerent and the first of the worshippers \nوَ اَزْهَدَ الزَّاهِدِیْنَ وَ رَحْمَۃُ اﷲِ \nWA AZHADAZ ZAAHEDEENA WA RAHMATULLAAHE\nand the most abstinent one and the Mercy of Allah \nوَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ وَ صَلَوَاتُهٗ وَ تَحِیَّاتُهٗ اَنْتَ \nWA BARAKAATOHU WA SALAWAATOHU WA TAHIYYAATOHU ANTA\nand His Blessings and His Salutations and His Greetings. You \nمُطْعِمُ الطَّعَامَ عَلٰی حُبِّهٖ مِسْكِیْنًا \nMUT-E’MUT TA-A’AMA A’LAA HUBBEHI MISKEENAN\nfed the disolates, the orphans \nوَ یَتِیْمًا وَ اَسِیْرًا لِوَجْهِ اﷲِ لاَ تُرِیْدُ \nWA YATEEMAN WA ASEERAN LEWAJHILLAAHE LAA TOREEDO\nand the captive in  the love of Allah, seeking His pleasure, you did \nمِنْهُمْ جَزَآئً وَلاَ شُكُوْراً وَ فِیْكَ \nMINHUM JAZAAA-AN WALAA SHOKOORAN WA FEEKA\nnot desire from them any recompense or thanks and concerning you \nاَنْزَلَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی وَ یُؤْثِرُوْنَ عَلٰٓی \nANZALALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA WA YOASEROONA A’LAA\nAllah, the Exalted has revealed, ‘And they give preference \nاَنْفُسِهِمْ وَلَوْ كَانَ بِهِمْ خَصَاصَۃٌ \nANFOSEHIM WA LAW KAANA BEHIM KHASAASATUN\nto others over themselves even though their resources scarce.’\nوَ مَنْ یُّوْقَ شُحَّ نَفْسِهٖ فَاُولٰٓئِكَ هُمُ \nWA MAN YOOQA SHO-HA NAFSEHI FA AOOLAAA-EKA HOMUL\nAnd one who guards against the stinginess of his self, then these are \nالْمُفْلِحُوْنَ وَ اَنْتَ الْكَاظِمُ لِلْغَیْظِ \nMUFLEHOONA ANTAL KAAZEMO LILGHAIZE\nthe successful ones and you were having control over anger \nوَالْعَافِیْ عَنِ النَّاسِ وَ اﷲُ یُحِبُّ \nWAL A’AFEE ANIN-NAASE WAL LAAHO YOHIBBUL\nand you were forgiving the people and Allah loves \nالْمُحْسِنِیْنَ وَ اَنْتَ الصَّابِرُ فِیْ \nMOHSENEENA WA ANTASSAABERO FIL\nthose who do good (to others) and you were patient \nالْبَاْسَآئِ وَ الضَّرَّآئِ وَحِیْنَ الْبَاْسِ \nBAA-SAAA-E WAZ ZARRAAA-E WA HEENA L BAASE\nin difficulties and troubles and misfortunes.\nوَ اَنْتَ الْقَاسِمُ بِالسَّوِیَّۃِ وَالْعَادِلُ \nWA ANTAL QAASEMO BIS SAWIYYATE WAL A’ADELO\nAnd you were equitable in distribution and just \nفِیْ الرَّعِیَّۃِ وَالْعَالِمُ بِحُدُوْدِ اﷲِ مِنْ \nFIR RA-E’YYATE WAL A’ALEMO BE HODOODILLAAHE MIN\namong the subjects and the most knowledgeable the limits imposed by Allah of \nجَمِیْعِ الْبَرِیَّۃِ وَاﷲُ تَعَالٰی اَخْبَرَ عَمَّا \nJAMEE-I’L BARIYYATE WALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA AKHBARA A’MMAA\nall the people and Allah has informed one and all concerning the \nاَوْلاَكَ مِنْ فَضْلِهٖ بِقَوْلِهٖ اَفَمَنْ كَانَ \nAWLAAKA MIN FAZLEHI BE QAWLEHI AFAMAN KAANA\nsuperiority He has granted you through His saying. Is the one who \nمُؤْمِنًا كَمَنْ كَانَ فَاسِقًا لاَ یَسْتَوٗنَ \nMOMENAN KAMAN KAANA FAASEQAN LAA YASTA-OONA\nis a believer akin to the one who is a transgressor. They are not equal.\nاَمَّا الَّذِیْنَ اٰمَنُوْا وَ عَمِلُوا \nAMMAL LAZEENA AAAMANOO WA A’MELUS\nAs for those who believe and do good, \nالصَّالِحَاتِ فَلَهُمْ جَنَّاتُ الْمَاْوٰی \nSAALEHAATE FALAHUM JANNAATUL MAAWA\nthen for them are the abodes of Paradise, \nنُزُلاً بِمَا كَانُوْا یَعْلَمُوْنَ وَ اَنْتَ \nNOZOLAN BEMA KAANO YA’LAMOONA WA ANTAL\na recompense for what they have done and have been \nالْمَخْصُوْصُ بِعِلْمِ التَّنْزِیْلِ وَ حُكْمِ \nMAKHSOOSO BE I’LMIT TANZEELE WA HUKMIT\nspecialised for knowledge of revelation and the wisdom \nالتَّاوِیْلِ وَ نَصِّ الرَّسُوْلِ وَلَكَ \nTAAWEELE WA NASSIR RASOOLE WA LAKAL\nof interpretation and the explicit mention by the Apostle and for you \nالْمَوَاقِفُ الْمَشْهُوْدَۃُ وَالْمَقَامَاتُ \nMAWAAQEFUL MASHOODATO WAL MAQAAMAATUL\nare distinguished stations and renowned positions and \nالْمَشْهُوْرَۃُ وَالْاَیَّامُ الْمَذْكُوْرَۃُ یَوْمَ \nMASHHOORATO WAL AYYAAMUL MAZKOORATO YAWMA\nthe celebrated days, the day \nبَدْرٍ وَ یَوْمَ الْاَحْزَابِ اِذْ زَاغَتِ \nBADRIN WA YAWMAL AHZAABE IZ ZAAGHATIL\nof Badr and the day of Ahzaab when the \nالْاَبْصَارُ وَ بَلَغَتِ الْقُلُوْبُ الْحَنَاجِرَ \nABSAARO WA BALAGHATIL QOLOOBUL HANAAJERA\neyes had severed and the hearts rose \nوَ تَظُنُّوْنَ بِاﷲِ الظُّنُوْنَ هُنَالِكَ ابْتُلِیَ \nWA TAZUNNOONA BILLAAHIZ ZONOONAA HONAALEKAB TOLEYAL\nupto the throats and you started having opinions about Allah, there was the examination \nالْمُؤْمِنُوْنَ وَ زُلْزِلُوا زِلْزَالاً شَدِیْدًا وَ \nMUMINOONA WA ZULZELOO ZILZAALAN SHAHEEDAN WA\nof the believers and they were shaken with a vigorous shaking \nاِذْ یَقُولُ الْمُنَافِقُوْنَ وَالَّذِیْنَ فِیْ \nIZ YAQOOLUL MONAAFEQOONA WAL LAZEENA FEE\nwhen the hypocrites and those in \nقُلُوْبِهِمْ مَرَضٌ مَا وَعَدَنَا اﷲُ وَ \nQOLOOBEHIM MARAZUN MAA WA-A’DANALLAAHO WA\nwhose hearts was sickness said: Allah and His Apostle have not promised us \nرَسُوْلُهٗ اِلاَّ غُرُوْراً وَ اِذْ قَالَتْ طَآئِفَۃٌ \nRASOOLOHU ILLAA GHOROORAN WA IZ QAALAT TAA-EFATUN\nanything except deception. When a group from among them said, \nمِنْهُمْ یَآ اَهْلَ یَثْرِبَ لاَ مُقَامَ لَكُمْ \nMINHUM YAA AHLA YASREBA LAA MOKAAMA LAKUM\n‘O the people of Medina! There  is no play of stay for you here, \nفَارْجِعُوْا وَ یَسْتَاْذِنُ فَرِیْقٌ مِنْهُمُ \nFARJE-O’O WA YASTAAZENO FAREEQUN MINHOMUN\nthen return back, while a group of them \nالنَّبِیَّ یَقُوْلُوْنَ اِنَّ بُیُوْتَنَا عَوْرَۃٌ وَ مَا \nNABEEYYA YAQOOLOONA INNA BOYOOTANAA A’WRATUN WAMAA\nwere saying: Surely our houses are empty even though they were not, \nهِیَ بِعَوْرَۃٍ اِنْ یُّرِیْدُوْنَ اِلاَّ فِرَاراً وَ \nHEYA BE A’WRATIN IN YOREEDOONA ILLAA FERAARAN WA\nthey only desired to run away. \nقَالَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی وَ لَمَّارَ اَی الْمُؤْمِنُوْنَ \nQAALALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA WALAMMAA RA-AL MOMENOONAL\nAnd Allah, the High, said, ‘And when the believers \nالْاَحْزَابَ قَالُوْا هٰذَا مَا وَعَدَنَا اﷲُ وَ \nAHZAABA QAALOO HAAZAA MAA WA A’DANALLAAHO WA\nsaw the allies, they said. That is what Allah and \nرَسُوْلُهٗ وَ صَدَقَ اﷲُ وَ رَسُوْلُهٗ وَ مَا \nRASOOLOHU WA SADAQALLAAHO WA MAA\nHis Apostle had promised us and Allah and His Apostle \nزَادَهُمْ اِلاَّ اِیْمَانًا وَ تَسْلِیْمًا فَقَتَلْتَ \nZAADAHUM ILLA EEMANAN WA TASLEEMAN FAQATALAT\nhave spoken the truth and their faith and submission \nعَمْرَهُمْ وَ هَزَمْتَ جَمْعَهُمْ وَ رَدَّ اﷲُ \nA’MRAHUM WA HAZAMTA JAM-A’HUM WA RADDAL LAAHUL\nwas augmented on account of it, then you killed Amr and defeated their armies and Allah \nالَّذِیْنَ كَفَرُوْا بِغَیْظِهِمْ لَمْ یَنالُوْا \nLAZEENA KAFAROO BE GHAIZEHIM LAM YANAALOO\nmade the disbelievers return in anger, they did not reach to any \nخَیْراً وَ كَفَی اﷲُ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ الْقِتَالَ \nKHAIRAN WA KAFALLAAHUL MOMINEENA QETAALA\ngoodness and Allah is Sufficient for the believers \nوَكَانَ اﷲُ قَوِیًّا عَزِیْزًا وَ یَوْمَ اُحُدٍ اِذْ \nWA KAANALLAAHO QAWIYYAN AZEEZAN WA YAWMA OHADIN IZ\nin fighting and Allah is Powerful, Honoured and on the Day of Ohad when \nیُصْعِدُوْنَ وَلاَ یَلْوٗنَ عَلٰی اَحَدٍ \nYUS-E’DOONA WALAA YAL-OONA A’LAA AHADIN\nthe people climbed atop the mountains and did not turn back to look at anyone \nوَالرَّسُوْلُ یَدْعُوْهُمْ فِیْ اُخْرٰهُمْ \nWAR RASOOLO YAD-O’OHUM FEE UKHRAAHUM\neven though the Apostle was calling them from behind and you were repelling the \nوَ اَنْتَ تَذُوْدُ بُهَمَ الْمُشْرِكِیْنَ عَنِ \nWA ANTA TAZOODO BOHAMAL MUSHREKEENA A’NIN\nscavengers from the polytheists away \nالنَّبِیِّ ذَاتَ الْیَمِیْنِ وَ ذَاتَ الشِّمَالِ \nNABBIYYE ZAATAL YAMEENE WA ZAATAS SHEMAALE\nfrom the Prophet from the right and from the left \nحَتّٰی رَدَّهُمُ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی عَنْكُمَا \nHATTA RADDAHOMULLAAHO TA-A’ALAA ANKOMAA\ntill the time Allah repelled them from you both \nخَآئِفِیْنَ وَ نَصَرَ بِكَ الْخَاذِلِیْنَ وَ یَوْمَ \nKHAAA-EFEENA WA NASARA BEKAL KHAAZELEENA WA YAWMA\nwhile they were in the state of fear and through you, He helped the forsaken ones and on the Day \nحُنَیْنٍ عَلٰی مَا نَطَقَ بِهِ التَّنْزِیْلُ اِذْ \nHONAYNIN A’LAA MAA NATAQA BEHIT TANZEELO IZ\nof Hunain as Quran says, ‘When the abundance of \nاَعْجَبَتْكُمْ كَثْرَتُكُمْ فَلَمْ تُغْنِ عَنْكُمْ \nA’AJABATKUM KASRATOKUM FALAM TUGHNE A’NKUN\nyour number amazed you but it did not benefit you \nشَیْئًا وَ ضَاقَتْ عَلَیْكُمُ الْاَرْضُ بِمَا \nSHAYAN WAZAA QAT ALAYKUMUL ARZO BEMAA\nat all and the earth became straitened for you in spite of \nرَحُبَتْ ثُمَّ وَلَّیْتُمْ مُدْبِرِیْنَ ثُمَّ اَنْزَلَ \nRAHOBAT SUMMA WALLAYTUM MUDBEREENA SUMMA ANZALAL\nits vastness, then you turned back, then \nاﷲُ سَكِیْنَتَهٗ عَلٰی رَسُوْلِهٖ وَ عَلَی \nLAAHO SAKEENATAHU A’LAA RASOOLEHI WA A’LAL\nAllah sent down tranquility upon His Apostle and the \nالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَالْمُؤْمِنُوْنَ اَنْتَ وَ مَنْ \nMOMINEENA WAL MUMINOONA ANTA WAMAN\nbelieving men and the term believers refers to you and \nیَلِیْكَ وَ عَمُّكَ الْعَبَّاسُ یُنَادِیْ \nYA-LEEKA WA A’MMOKAL A’BBAASO YONAADIL\nthose who were with you and your uncle Abbas kept \nالْمُنْهَزِمِیْنَ یَا اَصْحَابَ سُوْرَۃِ \nMUNHAZEMEENA YA ASHAABA SOORATIL\non calling out of the fleeing Muslims. O the people of \nالْبَقَرَۃِ یَا اَهْلِ بَیْعَۃِ الشَّجَرَۃِ حَتّٰی \nBAQARATE YAA AHLE BAYTISH SHAJARATE HATTAS\nthe chapter of the cow, O those who had pledged allegiance under the tree till \nاسْتَجَابَ لَهٗ قَوْمٌ قَدْ كَفَیْتَهُمُ الْمَؤُنَۃَ \nTAJAABA LAHU QAWMUN QAD KAFAYTOHOMUL MA-OONATA\na group of them responded. Then you arranged for their provisions \nوَ تَكَفَّلْتَ دُوْنَهُمُ الْمَعُوْنَۃَ فَعَادُوْا \nWA TAKAFFALTA DOONAHOMUL MA-O’ONATA FA-A’ADOO\nand became their protector for their daily necessities.\nاٰیِسِیْنَ مِنَ الْمَثُوْبَۃِ رَاجِیْنَ وَعْدَ اﷲِ \nAAYESEENA MENAL MASOOBATEHI RAAJEENA WA’DALLAAHE\nThen these people returned, despair of recompense, expectant of the promise of Allah,  \nتَعَالٰی بِالتَّوْبَۃِ وَ ذٰلِكَ قَوْلُ اﷲِ جَلَّ \nTA-A’ALAA BITTAWBATE WA ZAALEKA QAWLULLAAHE JALLA\nthe High, through repentance. And that is the saying of Allah, Honoured \nذِكْرُهٗ ثُمَّ یَتُوْبُ اﷲِ مِنْ بَعْدِ ذَالِكَ \nZIKRAHU SUMMA YATOOBULLAAHO MIN BA’DE ZAALEKA\nbe His Remembrance. Then Allah turned (with Mercy) \nعَلٰی مَنْ یَشَآئُ وَ اَنْتَ حَآئِزٌ دَرَجَۃَ \nA’LAA MAN YASHAAA-O WA ANTA HAA-EZUN DARAJATAS\nafter that to whomsoever He wished and you were  firmly on the grades \nالصَّبْرِ فَآئِزٌ بِعَظِیْمِ الْاَجْرِ وَ یَوْمَ \nSABRE FAAEZUN BE-A’ZEEMIL AJRE WAWMA\nof patience and successful with a great recompense and on the Day \nخَیْبَرَ اِذْ اَظْهَرَ اﷲُ خَوَرَ الْمُنَافِقِیْنَ \nKHAYBARA IZ AZHARALLAAHO KHAWARAL MONAAFEQEENA\nof Khaibar, when Allah exposed the slackness of the hypocrites \nوَ قَطَعَ دَابِرَ الْكَافِرِیْنَ \nWA QA-TA-A’ DAABERAL KAAFEREENA\nand cut off the roots of the disbelievers \nوَالْحَمْدُ لِلّٰهِ رَبِّ الْعَالَمِیْنَ \nWAL HAMDO LILLAAHE RABBIL A’ALAMEENA\nand all praise be to Allah, the Lord of the Universe \nوَلَقَدْ كَانُوْا عَاهَدُوْا اﷲَ مِنْ قَبْلُ \nWA LAQAD KAANOO A’AHADULLAAHA MIN QABLO\nand surely they had made a covenant from Allah from before \nلاَ یُوَلُّوْنَ الْاَدْبَارَ وَ كَانَ عَهْدُ اﷲِ \nLAA YOWALLOONAL ADBAARA WA KAANA A’HADULLAHE\nthat they will not turn their backs and surely the covenant of Allah \nمَسْؤُلاً مَوْلاَیَ اَنْتَ الْحُجَّۃُ الْبَالِغَۃُ \nMAS-OOLAN MAWLAAYA ANTAL HUJJATUL BAALEGHATO\nwill be questioned. O my master, you are the far-reaching \nوَالْمُحَجَّۃُ الْوَاضِحَۃُ وَالنِّعْمَۃُ \nWAL MOHAJJATUL WAAZEHATO WAN-NEA’MATUS\nargument and the evident aim and the perfect bounty \nالسَّابِغَۃُ وَالْبُرْهَانُ الْمُنِیْرُ فَهَنِیْٓئًا لَكَ \nSAABEGHATO WAL BURHAANUL  MONEERO FA-HANEE-AN LAKA\nand the evident proof. Then congratulations be to you, \nبِمَا اٰتٰیكَ اﷲُ مِنْ فَضْلٍ وَ تَبًّا \nBEMA AATAAKALLAAHO MIN FAZLIN WA TABBAN\ndue to what Allah has granted you from the grace, and may it be away from your enemy, \nلِشَانِئِكَ ذِی الْجَهْلِ شَهِدْتَ مَعَ \nLESHAANE-EKA ZILJAHLE SHAHIDTA MA-A’N\nthe ignorant, You participated in all the \nالنَّبِیِّ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ جَمِیْعَ \nNABIYYE SALLALLAAHO ALAYHE WA AALEHI JAMEE-A’N\nbattles alongwith the Holy Prophet, blessings of Allah be on him and his progeny\nحُرُوبِهٖ وَ مَغَازِیْهِ تَحْمِلُ الرَّایَۃَ \nHOROOBEHI WA MAGHAAZEEHE TAH-MELUR RAAYATA\nyou carried the flags while leading him and were fighting with the sword \nاَمَامَهٗ وَ تَضْرِبُ بِالسَّیْفِ قُدَّامَهٗ ثُمَّ \nAMAAMAHU WA TAZREBO BIS SAYFE QUDDAAMAHU SUMMA\nin front of him. Then \nلِخَرْمِكَ الْمَشْهُوْرِ وَ بَصِیْرَتِكَ فِی \nLEHAZMEKAL MASH-HOORE WA BASEERATEKA FIL\ndue to Your famed prudence and your foresight \nالْاُمُوْرِ اَمَّرَكَ فِی الْمَوَاطِنِ وَ لَمْ \nOMOORE AMMARAKA FIL MAWAATENE WA LAM\nin the affairs, he made you \nیَكُنْ عَلَیْكَ اَمِیْرٌ وَكَمْ مِنْ اَمْرٍ \nYAKUN A’LAYKA AMEERUN WAKAM MIN AMRIN\nthe commander in various places and there was no commander over you and there were so many affairs \nصَدَّكَ عَنْ اِمْضَآئِ عَزْمِكَ فِیْهِ التُّقٰی \nSADDAKA A’N IMZAAA-E A’ZMEKA FEEHIT TOQAA\nin which piety kept desisted you from its \nوَاتَّبَعَ غَیْرُكَ فِیْ مِثْلِهِ الْهَوٰی فَظَنَّ \nWAT-TABA-A’ GHAYROKA FEE MISLEHIL HAWAA FAZANNAL\nperformance while others have followed their desires in committing. \nالْجَاهِلُوْنَ اَنَّكَ عَجَزْتَ عَمَّا اِلَیْهِ \nJAAHELOONA ANNAKA A’JAZTA A’MMAA ELAYHIN\nThen the ignorant used to opine that you were helpless \nانْتَهٰی ضَلَّ وَاﷲِ الظَّآنُّ لِذٰلِكَ وَمَا \nTAHAA ZALLA WALLAAHIZ ZAAANNO LEZAALEKA WA MAH\nin their performance. It is not like that rather, by Allah, the one who thinks so is \nاهْتَدٰی وَ لَقَدْ اَوْضَحْتَ مَآ اَشْكَلَ \nTADAA WA LAQAD AWZAHTA MAAA ASHKALA\nindeed deviated in his opinion and he is not guided and certainly by your words, \nمِنْ ذٰلِكَ لِمَنْ تَوَهَّمَ وَامْتَرٰی \nMIN ZAALEKA LEMAN TAWAHHAMA WAMTARAA\nyou had removed the skepticism of the presumers \nبِقَوْلِكَ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْكَ قَدْ یَرَی \nBE QAWLEKA SALLALLAAHO A’LAYKA QAD YARAL\nand the falsehood of the slanderers. Blessings of Allah be upon you, ‘Certainly the variable \nالْحُوَّلُ الْقُلَّبُ وَجْهَ الْحِیْلَۃِ وَ دُوْنَهَا \nHUWWALUL QULLABO WAJHAL HEELATEH WA DOONAHAA\nand adaptable ones see the rise which \nحَاجِزٌ مِنْ تَقْوَی اﷲِ فَیَدْعُهَا رَاْیَ \nHAA-JEZUN MIN TAQWALLAAHE FAYAD-O’HAA RAAYAL\nonly fear of Allah can impede. Then they forsake it \nالْعَیْنِ وَ یَنْتَهِزُ فُرْصَتَهَا مَنْ لاَ \nA’YNE WA YANTAHEZO FURSATAHAA MAN LAA\nintentionally and those who have no soft-corner or \nحَرِیْجَۃَ لَهٗ فِی الدِّیْنِ صَدَقْتَ وَ \nHAREEJATA LAHU FIDDEENE SADAQTA WA\nconcern for religion, they seize this opportunity.’ Surely you have spoken the truth and \nخَسِرَ الْمُبْطِلُوْنَ وَ اِذْ مَاكَرَكَ \nKHASERAL MUBTELOONA WA IZ MAAKARAKAN\nthe deniers are in loss. And when the \nالنَّاكِثَانِ فَقَالاَ نُرِیْدُ الْعُمْرَۃَ فَقُلْتَ \nNAAKESAANE FAQAALAA NOREEDUL U’MRATA FAQULTA\ncovenant breakers plotted against you and said that we have come to perform the ‘umrah’, you told them.\nلَهُمَا لَعَمْرُكُمَا مَا تُرِیْدَانِ الْعُمْرَۃَ \nLAHOMAA LA-A’MRO KOMAA MAA TOREEDAANIL U’MRATA\nI swear by your life, you do not intend to perform umrah, \nلٰكِنْ تُرِیْدَانِ الْغَدْرَۃَ فَاَخَذْتَ الْبَیْعَۃَ \nLAAKIN TOREEDAANIL GHADRATA FA-AKHAZTAL BAYA’TA\nrather your intention is that of deceit. Then you took the pledge of allegiance \nعَلَیْهِمَا وَ جَدَّدْتَ الْمِیْثَاقَ فَجَدَّا \nA’LAYHEMAA WA JADDADTAL MEESAAQA FAJADDA\nfrom both of them and renewed the covenant with them, they strove and struggled \nفِی النِّفَاقِ نَبَّهْتَهُمَا عَلٰی فِعْلِهِمَا \nFIN NEFAAQE NABBAH-TAHOMAA A’LAA FE’LEHEMAA\nin acts of hypocrisy. Then when you appraised them of their actions, \nاَغْفَلاَ وَ عَادَا وَ مَا انْتَفَعَا وَ كَانَ \nAGHFALAA WA-A’ADAA WA MAN TAFA-A’A WA KAANA\nthey were negligent and returned and did not pay \nعَاقِبَۃُ اَمْرِهِمَا خُسْراً ثُمَّ تَلاَهُمَا \nA’AQEBATO AMREHEMAA KHUSRAN SUMMA TALAAHOMAA\nany heed and the end-result of their affair was ‘loss’.\nاَهْلُ الشَّامِ فَسِرْتَ اِلَیْهِمْ بَعْدَ \nAHLUSH SHAAME FASIRTA ELAYHIM B’ADAL\nThen the people of Damascus followed them and you took after \nالْاِعْذَارِ وَهُمْ لاَ یَدِیْنُوْنَ دِیْنَ الْحَقِّ \nEA’ZAARE WAHUM LAA YADEENOONA DEENAL HAQQE\ncompleting the argument, rose up to defend against them while they did not believe in the true religion \nوَلاَ یَتَدَبَّرُوْنَ الْقُرْاٰنَ هَمَجٌ رَعَاعٌ \nWA LAA YATADABBAROONAL QUR-AANA HAMAJUN RA-A’A-U’N\nand did not ponder on the Holy Quran. They were debased, foolish and \nضَآلُّوْنَ وَ بِالَّذِیْٓ اُنْزِلَ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ \nZAAALLOONA WA BILLAZEE UNZELA A’LAA MOHAMMADIN\ndeviated and did not believe in all that \nفِیْكَ كَافِرُوْنَ وَلِاَهْلِ الْخِلاَفِ \nFEEKA KAAFEROONA WA LEAHLIL KHELAAFE\nwas revealed on Mohammad concerning you. \nعَلَیْكَ نَاصِرُوْنَ وَ قَدْ اَمَرَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی \nA’LAYKA NAASEROONA WA QAD AMARALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA\nThey assisted your enemies while Allah, the High, \nبِاتِّبَاعِكَ وَ نَدَبَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ اِلٰی \nBIT-TEBAAE’KA WA NADABAL MOMINEENA ELAA\nhad ordered them to follow you and had called them to \nنَصْرِكَ وَ قَالَ عَزَّوَجَلَّ یَآ اَیُّهَا الَّذِیْنَ \nNASREKA WAQAALAA A’ZZA WAJALLA YAA AYYOHAL LAZEENA\nassist you and He, the Honoured, the Majestic, said: O those who believe! \nاٰمَنُوْا اتَّقُوا اﷲَ وَ كُونُوا مَعَ \nAAAMANUT TAQULLAAHA WA KOONOO MA-A’S\nFear Allah and be with the \nالصَّادِقِیْنَ مَوْلاَیَ بِكَ ظَهَرَ الْحَقُّ \nSAADEQEENA MAWLAAYA BEKA ZAHARAL HAQQO\ntruthful ones.’ O my master! Through you the truth \nوَ قَدْ نَبَذَهُ الْخَلْقُ وَ اَوْضَحْتَ \nWA QAD NABAZHUL KHALQO WA AWZAHTAS\nhas been manifested when the creatures had forsaken it and you have made evident \nالسُّنَنَ بَعْدَ الدُّرُوْسِ وَالطَّمْسِ \nSONANA BA’DAD DOROOSE WAT TAMSE\nthe ‘tradition’ after it had been eradicated and effaced. \nفَلَكَ سَابِقَۃُ الْجِهَادِ عَلٰی تَصْدِیْقِ \nFALAKA SAABEQATUL JEHAADE A’LAA TASDEEQIT\nThen you initially fought in the way of establishing the truth \nالتَّنْزِیْلِ وَ لَكَ فَضِیْلَۃُ الْجِهَادِ عَلٰی \nTANZEELE WA LAKA FAZEELATAHUL JEHAADE A’LAA\nof the revelation of Holy Quran and later on you fought to establish the actualization \nتَحْقِیْقِ التَّاْوِیْلِ وَ عَدُوُّكَ عَدُوُّ اﷲِ \nTAHQEEQIT TAAWEELE WA A’DOOWOKA A’DOOWULLAAHE\nof the interpretation and your enemy \nجَاحِدٌ لِرَسُوْلِ اﷲِ یَدْعُوْ بَاطِلاً \nJAAHEDUN LE RASOOLILLAAHE YAD-O’O BAATELAN\nwas the enemy of Allah, denier of the Apostle of Allah, he was calling towards falsehood \nوَ یَحْكُمُ جَآئِرًا وَ یَتَاَمَّرُ غَاصِبًا وَ \nWA YAHKOMO JAAA-ERAN WA YATA-AMMARO GHAASEBAN WA\nand ordering for tyranny and ruling with usurpation and \nیَدْعُوْ حِزْبَهٗ اِلَی النَّارِ وَ عَمَّارٌ \nYAD-O’O HIZBAHU ILAN NAARE WA A’MMAA RUN\nwas calling his party towards the fire while Ammar was \nیُجَاهِدُ وَ یُنَادِیْ بَیْنَ الصَّفَّیْنِ \nYOJAAHEDO WA YONAADEE BAYNAS SAFFAYNIR\nfighting on your side and was calling out between the rows of battlefield:\nالرَّوَاحَ الرَّوَاحَ اِلَی الْجَنَّۃِ وَ لَمَّا \nRAWAAHAR RAWAAHA ELAL JANNATE WA LAMMAS\nHasten towards Paradise and when he was thirsty, \nاسْتَسْقٰی فَسُقِیَ اللَّبَنُ كَبَّرَ وَ قَالَ \nTASQAA FASOQEYAL LABANO KABBARA WA QAALA\nhe was offered milk and drink, he glorified Allah and stated that the \nقَالَ لِیْ رَسُوْلُ اﷲِ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْهِ \nQAALA LEE RASOOLULLAAHE SALLALLAAHO ALAYHE\nApostle of Allah peace be upon him and his \nوَاٰلِهٖ اٰخِرُ شَرَابِكَ مِنَ الدُّنْیَا ضَیَاحٌ \nWA AALEHI WA AAKHERO SHARAABEKA MENAD DUNYAA ZAYAAHUN\nprogeny had told him: The last drink that you will have in this world \nمِنْ لَبَنٍ وَ تَقْتُلُكَ الْفِئَۃُ الْبَاغِیَۃُ \nMIN LABANIN WA TAQTOLOKAL FE-ATUL BAAGHEYATO\nwill be milk and the rebellious group will kill you. \nفَاعْتَرَضَهٗ اَبُوالْعَادِیَۃِ الْفَزَارِیُّ فَقَتَلَهٗ \nFA-A’TARAZAHU ABUL A’ADEYATEHIL FAZAARIYYO FAQATALATAHU\nThen Abul Aadiyaa al-Fazaari came forward and he killed Ammaar. \nفَعَلٰی اَبِیْ الْعَادِیَۃِ لَعْنَۃُ اﷲِ وَلَعْنَۃُ \nFA-A’LAA ABIL A’ADEYATE LA’NATULLAAHE WA LA’NATO\nThen upon Abul Aadiyah be the curse of Allah, \nمَلآئِكَتِهٖ وَ رُسُلِهٖ اَجْمَعِیْنَ وَ عَلٰی \nMALAAA-EKATEHI WA ROSOLEHI AJMA-E’ENA WA A’LAA\nHis angles and His Apostles, all of them and also on\nمَنْ سَلَّ سَیْفَهٗ عَلَیْكَ وَسَلَلْتَ \nMAN SALLA SAYFAHU A’LAYKA WA SALALTA\nthose who raised their swords against you and you drew \nسَیْفَكَ عَلَیْهِ یَا اَمِیْرَ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ مِنَ \nSAYFAKA A’LAYHE YAA AMEERAL MOMINEENA MENAL\nyour sword against them, be they, O the commander of the faithful, \nالْمُشْرِكِیْنَ وَالْمُنَافِقِیْنَ اِلٰی یَوْمِ \nMUSHREKEENA WAL MONAAFEQEENA ELAA YAWMID\nfrom the polytheists or the hypocrites, till the Day \nالدِّیْنِ وَ عَلٰی مَنْ رَضِیَ بِمَا سَآئَكَ \nDEENE WA A’LAA MAN RAZEYA BEMA SAAA-AKA\nof Judgement and those who were satisfied with the evil \nوَلَمْ یَكْرَهْهُ وَ اَغْمَضَ عَیْنَهٗ وَلَمْ \nWA LAM YAKRAH-HO WA AGHMAZA A’YNAHU WALAM \nthat afflicted you and did not detest it, and covered it up and \nیُنْكِرْ اَوْ اَعَانَ عَلَیْكَ بِیَدٍ اَوْ لِسَانٍ \nYUNKIR  AW A-A’ANA A’LAYKA BEYADIN AW LESAANIN\ndid not deny it nor helped you to ward it off by their hand or tongue or sat down \nاَوْ قَعَدَ عَنْ نَصْرِكَ اَوْ خَذَلَ عَنِ \nAW QA-A’DAN A’N NASREKA AW KHAZALA A’NIL\nwhen it came to helping you and forsook you in \nالْجِهَادِ مَعَكَ اَوْ غَمَطَ فَضْلَكَ وَ \nJEHAADE MA-A’KA AW GHAMATA FAZLAKA WA\nfighting and tried to reduce your superiority and \nجَحَدَ حَقَّكَ اَوْ عَدَلَ بِكَ مَنْ \nJAHADA HAQQAKA AW A’DALA BEKA MAN\ndenied your right or equated you with the one whom Allah has made you as having more authority on him then he has on himself. \nجَعَلَكَ اﷲَ اَوْلٰی بِهٖ مِنْ نَفْسِهٖ وَ \nJA-A’LAKALLAAHA AWLAA BEHI MIN NAFSEHI WA \nSalutation of Allah be upon you \nصَلَوَاتُ اﷲِ عَلَیْكَ وَ رَحْمَۃُ اﷲِ\nSALAWAATULLAAHE A’LAYKA WA RAHMATULLAHE\nand the Mercy of Allah and His \nوَ بَرَكَاتُهٗ وَ سَلاَمُهٗ وَ \nWA BARAKAATOHU WA SALAAMOHU WA\nBlessings and His Peace and \nتَحِیَّاتُهٗ وَ عَلَی الْاَئِمَّۃِ مِنْ اٰلِكَ \nTAHIYYAATOHU WA A’LAL A-IMMATE MIN AALEKAT\nHis Greetings and upon the leaders from the pure \nالطَّاهِرِیْنَ اِنَّهٗ حَمِیْدٌ مَجِیْدٌ وَالْاَمْرُ \nTAAHEREENA INNAHU HAMEEDUN MAJEEDUN WAL AMRUL\nprogeny, surely He is the Praiseworthy, Majestic.\nالْاَعْجَبُ وَالْخَطْبُ الْاَفَظْعُ بَعْدَ \nA-A’JABO WAL KHATABUL AFAZ-O’ BA’DA\nAnd a most astonishing event and the most detestable situation after \nجَحْدِكَ حَقَّكَ غَصْبُ الصِّدِّیْقَۃِ \nJAHDEKA HAQQAKA GHASBUS SIDDEEQATTIT\nthe denial of your right was the usurpation of Fadak that belonged to the Truthful and Pure \nالطَّاهِرَۃِ الزَّهْرَآئِ سَیِّدَۃِ النِّسَآئِ \nTAAHERATIZ ZAHRAAA-E SAYYEDATIN NESAAA-E\nand Fair lady (Fatimah), the leader of the women (of the universe) \nفَدَكًا وَرَدُّ شَهَادَتِكَ وَ شَهَادَۃِ \nFADAKAN WA RADDO SHAHAADATEKA WA SHAHAADATIS\nand the rejection of your testimony and that \nالسَّیِّدَیْنِ سُلاَلَتِكَ وَ عِتْرَۃِ \nSAYYEDAYNE SOLAALATEKA WA I’TRATAL\nof the two leaders from the progeny \nالْمُصْطَفٰی صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْكُمْ وَ قَدْ \nMUSTAFA SALLALLAAHO A’LAYKUM WA QAD\nof Al-Mustafa blessings of Allah be on you concerning \nاَعْلَی اﷲُ تَعَالٰی عَلَی الْاُمَّۃِ دَرَجَتَكُمْ \nA-A’LALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA A’LAL UMMATE DARAJATAKUM\nit while Allah has extolled your status over the nations and has raised your position \nوَ رَفَعَ مَنْزِلَتَكُمْ وَ اَبَانَ فَضْلَكُمْ \nWA RAFA-A’ MANZELATAKUM WA ABAANA FAZLAKUM\nand has made clean your superiority and has \nوَ شَرَّفَكُمْ عَلَی الْعَالَمِیْنَ فَاَذْهَبَ \nWA SHARRAFAKUM A’LAL A’ALAMEENA FA-AZHABA\nhonoured you over the universe, \nعَنْكُمُ الرِّجْسَ وَ طَهَّرَكُمْ تَطْهِیْراً \nA’NKOMUR RIJSA WA TAHHARAKUM TATHEERAN\nthen He removed from you all types of filth and has purified you as purification ought to be, \nقَالَ اﷲُ عَزَّوَجَلَّ اِنَّ الْاِنْسَانَ خُلِقَ \nQAALALLAAHO AZZA WA JALLA INNAL INSAANA KHOLEQA\nAllah, the Honoured, the Majestic. Surely, man has been created greedy (by nature) and \nهَلُوْعًا اِذَا مَسَّهُ الشَّرُّ جَزُوْعًا وَ اِذَا \nHALOO-A’N EZAA MASSAHUSH SHARRO JAZOO-A’N WA EZAA\nwhen evil afflicts him, he becomes anxious and \nمَسَّهُ الْخَیْرُ مَنُوْعًا اِلاَّ الْمُصَلِّیْنَ \nMASSAHUL KHAYRO MANOO-A’N ILLAL MOSALLEENA\nwhen good occurs to him, he does not acknowledge except the praying ones. \nفَاسْتَثْنَی اﷲُ تَعَالٰی نَبِیَّهٗ الْمُصْطَفٰی وَ \nFASTASNALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA NABIYYAHUL MUSTAFA WA\nThen Allah praised His Prophet al-Mustafa and \nاَنْتَ یَا سَیِّدَ الْاَوْصِیَآئِ مِنْ جَمِیْعِ \nANTA YAA SAYYEDAL AWSEYAAA-E MIN JAMEE-I’L\nyou, O the chief of the vicegerents, from the entire creation. \nالْخَلْقِ فَمَا اَعْمَهَ مَنْ ظَلَمَكَ عَنِ \nKHALQE FAMAA A’AMAHA MAN ZALAMAKA A’NIL\nHow blinded is he, who has oppressed you concerning your right, then through deceit \nالْحَقِّ ثُمَّ اَفْرَضُوْكَ سَهْمَ ذَوِی \nHAQQE SUMMA AFRAZOOKA SAHMA ZAWIL\nthey took away the share of the near ones of the Apostle and through oppression, \nالْقُرْبٰی مَكْراً وَاَحَادُوْهُ عَنْ اَهْلِهٖ \nQURBAA MAKRAN WA AHAADOOHO A’N AHLEHI\nthey prevented it from reaching to its rightful owners. \nجَوْراً فَلَمَّا اٰلَ الْاَمْرُ اِلَیْكَ اَجْرَیْتَهُمْ \nJAWRAN FALAMMAA AALAL AMRO ELAYKA AJRAYTAHUM\nThen, when the affair (of Caliphate) came to you, you left them \nعَلٰی مَا اَجْرَ یَا رَغْبَۃً عَنْهُمَا بِمَا عِنْدَ \nA’LAA MAA AJRAYAA RAGHBATAN A’NHOMAA BEMAA I’NDAL\non their own and kept away from them, seeking reward from \nاﷲِ لَكَ فَاَشْبَهَتْ مِحْنَتُكَ بِهِمَا \nLAAHE LAKA FASHBAHAT MEHNATOKA BEHEMAA\nAllah. How similar is your trial to those of the \nمِحَنَ الْاَنْبِیَآئِ عَلَیْهِمُ السَّلاَمُ عِنْدَ \nMEHANAL ANBEYAAA-E A’LAYHEMUSSALAAMO I’NDAL\nProphets, peace be upon them, in being \nالْوَحْدَۃِ وَ عَدَمِ الْاَنْصَارِ وَ اَشْبَهْتَ \nWAHDATE WA ‘ADAMIL ANSAARE WA ASHBAHTA\nleft alone and devoid of any helpers.\nفِی الْبَیَاتِ عَلَی الْفِرَاشِ الذَّبِیْحَ \nFIL BAYAATE A’LAL FERAASHIZ ZABEEHA\nYou were similar to the sacrificed  ‘Ismaeel’ when you slept \nعَلَیْهِ السَّلاَمُ اِذَا اَجَبْتَ كَمَا اَجَابَ \nA’LAYHIS SALAAMO EZAA AJABTA KAMAA AJAABA\non the bed of the Apostle in the night of migration because you responded in \nوَ اَطَعْتَ كَمَا اَطَاعَ اِسْمٰعِیْلُ صَابِرًا \nWA ATA’TA KAMAA ATAA-A’ ISMAAE’ELO SAABERAN\nthe same manner as him and you obeyed that just as Ismael obeyed, being patient \nمُحْتَسِباً اِذْ قَالَ لَهٗ یَا بُنَیَّ اِنِّیْٓ اَرٰی \nMOHTASEBAN IZ QAALA LAHU YA BONAYYA INNI ARAA\nand forebearing. When Ibrahim said to him, ‘O my son! Surely, I see \nفِی الْمَنَامِ اَنِّیْ اَذْبَحُكَ فَانْظُرْ مَاذَا \nFIL MANAAME ANNI AZBAHOKA FANZUR MAAZA\nin the dream that I am slaughtering you, then what \nتَریٰ قَالَ یَا اَبَتِ افْعَلْ مَا تُؤْمَرُ \nTARAA QAALA YAA ABATIF-A’L MAA TOAMARO\ndo you say? He said, ‘O father! You carry out what you have been ordered.\nسَتَجِدُنِیْ اِنْشَآئَ اﷲُ مِنَ الصَّابِرِیْنَ وَ \nSATAJEDONEE INSHAA-ALLAAHO MENAS SAABEREENA WA\nYou will soon find me among the patient ones and \nكَذَالِكَ اَنْتَ لَمَّا اَبَاتَكَ النَّبِیُّ صَلَّی \nKAZAALEKA ANTA LAMMA ABAATAKAN NABIYYO SALLAL\nyou also recited in the same manner when the Prophet (blessings be \nاﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ وَ اَمَرَكَ اَنْ تَضْجِعَ \nLAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI WA AMARAKA AN TAZJE-A’ \nupon him and his progeny) ordered you to spend the \nفِیْ مَرْقَدِهٖ وَاقِیًا لَهٗ بِنَفْسِكَ \nFEE MARQADEHI WAAQEYAN LAHU BE NAFSEKA\nnight sleeping in his bed in order that his life be saved. \nاَسْرَعْتَ اِلٰی اِجَابَتِهٖ مُطِیْعًا وَ \nASRA’TA ELAA EJAABATEHI MOTEE-A’N WA\nThen you responded very quickly and prepared \nلِنَفْسِكَ عَلَی الْقَتْلُ مَوَطِّنًا فَشَكَرَ \nLE NAFSEKA A’LAL QATLO MAWATTENAN FA-SHAKARAL\nyourself to die obediently. \nاﷲُ تَعَالٰی طَاعَتَكَ وَ اَبَانَ عَنْ جَمِیْلِ \nLAAHO TA-A’ALAA TAA-A’TAKA WA ABAANA A’N JAMEELE\nThen Allah thanked your obedience and manifested your good \nفِعْلِكَ بِقَوْلِهٖ جَلَّ ذِكْرُهٗ وَ مِنَ النَّاسِ \nFE’LAKA BE QAWLEHI JALLA ZIKROHU WA MENAN NAASE\ndeed through His saying, ‘And from among the men are those \nمَنْ یَّشْرِیْ نَفْسَهُ ابْتِغَآئَ مَرْضَاتِ \nMAYN YASHREE NAFSAAHUN BEGHAAA-A MARZAATIL\nwho sell their souls to seek the satisfaction of Allah.\nاﷲِ ثُمَّ مِحْنَتُكَ یَوْمَ صِفِّیْنَ وَ قَدْ \nLLAHE SUMMA MEHNATOKA YAWMA SIFFEENA WA QAD\nAnd then your examination of the Day of Siffeen when \nرُفِعَتِ الْمَصَاحِفُ حِیْلَۃً وَ مَكْراً \nROFE-A’TIL MASAAHEFO HEELATAN WA MAKRAN\npeople raised the Holy Quran in deceit, the people \nفَاَعْرَضَ الشَّكَّ وَ غُرِفَ الْحَقُّ \nFA A-A’RAZASH SHAKKA WAGHOREFIL HAQQO\nbecame skeptical and truth was covered, \nوَاتُّبِعَ الظَّنُّ اَشْبَهَتْ مِحْنَۃَ هَارُوْنَ \nWAT TOBE-A’Z ZANNO ASHBAHAT MEHNATA HAAROONA\nand conjectures were followed.This resembled the examination of Haroon \nاِذْ اَمَّرَهٗ مُوْسٰی عَلٰی قَوْمِهٖ فَتَفَرَّقُوْا \nIZ AMMARAHU MOOSA A’LAA QAWMEHI FATAFARRAQOO\nwhen Moosa made them the leader of his nation then they separated \nعَنْهُ وَ هَارُوْنُ یُنَادِیْ بِهِمْ وَ یَقُوْلُ \nA’NHO WA HAAROONO YONAADEE BEHIM WA YAQOOLO\nfrom him while Haroon was calling to them saying, \nیَا قَوْمٍ اِنَّمَا فُتِنْتُمْ بِهٖ وَ اِنَّ رَبَّكُمُ \nYAA QAWME INNAMAA FOTINTUM BEHI WA INNA RABBAKOMUR\n‘O my  people, surely you are being examined through this and surely your Lord \nالرَّحْمٰنُ فَاتَّبِعُونِیْ وَاَطِیْعُوْْٓا اَمْرِیْ \nRAHMAANO FATTABE-O-ONEE WA ATEE-O’O AMREE\nis the All-Beneficent, then you follow me and obey my command.’\nقَالُوْا لَنْ نَبْرَحَ عَلَیْهِ عَاكِفِیْنَ حَتّٰی \nQAALOO LAN NABRAHA A’LAYHE A’AKEFEENA HATTA\nThey  replied, ‘We will keep on worshipping the calf till \nیَرْجِعَ اِلَیْنَا مُوْسیٰ وَ كَذٰلِكَ اَنْتَ \nYARJE-A’ ELAYNA MOOSAA WA KAZAALEKA ANTA\nthe time Moosa returns. The same things occurred with you. When the Holy Quran \nلَمَّا رُفِعَتِ الْمَصَاحِفُ قُلْتَ یَا قَوْمِ \nLAMMA ROFE-A’TIL MASAAHEFO QULTA YAA QAWME\nwere being raised, you called out, O my people, \nاِنَّمَا فُتِنْتُمْ بِهَا وَ خُدِعْتُمْ فَعَصَوْكَ وَ \nINNAMA FOTINTUM BEHAA WA KHO-DEA’TUM FA A’SAWKA WA\nyou are being examined by it and you are being deceived, \nخَالَفُوْا عَلَیْكَ وَاسْتَدْعَوْا نَصْبَ \nKHAALAFOO A’LAYKA WASTAD-O’O NASBAL\nthen they disobeyed you and opposed you and called for arbitration\nالْحَكَمَیْنِ فَاَبَیْتَ عَلَیْهِمْ وَ تَبَرَّاْتَ \nHAKAMAYNE FA ABAYTA A’LAYHIM WA TABARRAATA\nso you refused and disowned from them \nاِلَی اﷲِ مِنْ فِعْلِهِمْ وَ فَوَّضْتَهٗ اِلَیْهِمْ \nELALLAAHE MIN FEA’LEHIM WA FAWWAZTAHU ELAYHIM\ninfront of Allah and you left the matter to them. \nفَلَمَّآ اَسْفَرَ الْحَقُّ وَ سَفِهَ الْمُنْكَرُ \nFALAMMA ASFARAL HAQQO WA SAFEHAL MUNKARO \nThen when the truth was made evident and \nوَاعْتَرَفُوْا بِالزَّلَلِ وَالْجَوْرِ عَنِ \nWA’TARAFOO BIZZALALE WAL JAWRE A’NIL\nthe foolishness was exposed and they admitted to their mistakes and tyranny and opposed \nالْقَصْدِ اخْتَلَفُوْا مِنْ بَعْدِهٖ وَ اَلْزَمُوْكَ \nQASDIKH TALAFOO MIN BA’DEHI WA ALZAMOOKA\noppression after that and made allegations that you had \nعَلٰی سَفَهِ التَّحْكِیْمَ الَّذِیْٓ اَبَیْتَهٗ وَ \nA’LAA SAFAEHIT TAHKEEMALLAZEE ABAYTAHU WA\nset up the foolish act of arbitration which in fact you had opposed and they wanted it.\nاَحَبُّوْهُ وَ خَطَرْتَهٗ وَ اَبَاحُوَاذَنْبَهُمُ \nAHABBOOHU WA KHATARATAHU WA ABAAHOWAA ZANBAHOMUL\nYou warned them about it but they deemed their sin as permissible. \nالَّذِیْ اقْتَرَفُوْهُ وَ اَنْتَ عَلٰی نَهْجِ \nLAZIQ TARAFOOHO WA ANTA A’LAA NAHJE \nWhile you were on the peak of foresight \nبَصِیْرَۃٍ وَ هُدًی وَهُمْ عَلٰی سُنَنٍ \nBASEERAT IN WAHODAN WAHUM A’LAA SONANIN\nand guidance and they were on the path of \nضَلاَلَۃٍ وَعَمًی فَمَا زَالُوْا عَلَی \nZALAALATIN WA A’MAN FAMAA ZAALOO A’LAN\ndeviation and blindness. They then persisted in their \nالنِّفَاقِ مُصَرِّیْنَ وَ فِی الْغَیِّ مُتَرَدِّدِیْنَ \nNEFAAQE MOSABBEREENA WAFIL GHAYYE MOTARADDEDEENA\nhypocrisy and were lying in deviation till Allah made them taste the evil consequences of their actions,\nحَتّٰی اَذَاقَهُمُ اﷲُ وَ بَالَ اَمْرِهِمْ \nHATTAA AZAAQAHOMULLAAHO WA BAALA AMREHIM\nthen Allah caused to die the one \nفَاَمَاتَ بِسَیْفِكَ مَنْ عَانَدَكَ فَشَقِیَ \nFA AMAATA BESAYFEKA MAN A’ANADAKA FA SHAQEYA\nwho opposed you by your sword while he was unfortunate \nوَهَوٰی وَ اَحْیٰی بِحُجَّتِكَ مَنْ سَعَدَ \nWA HAWAA WA AHYAA BEHUJJATEKA MAN SA-A’DA\nand deviated. And He enlivened by your proof, the one who was fortunate \nفَهُدِیَ صَلَوَاتُ اﷲِ عَلَیْكَ غَادِیَۃً \nFA-HODEYA SALAWAATULLAAHE A’LAYKA GHAADEYATAN\nand was guided, blessings of Allah be you, morning and evening, from the beginning to the end, \nوَرَآئِحَۃً وَ عَاكِفَۃً وَ ذَاهِبَۃً فَمَا \nWARAAA-EHATAN WA AAKEFATAN WA ZAAHEBATAN FAMAA\nin motion and while still, then no eulogizers can truly \nیُحِیْطُ الْمَادِحٌ وَصْفَكَ وَلاَ یُحِیْطُ\nYOHEETUL MAADEHUN WASFAKA WALAA YOHEETUT\ncomprehend your attributes and neither can \nالطَّاعِنُ فَضْلِكَ اَنْتَ اَحْسَنُ الْخَلْقِ \nTAA-E’NO FAZLEKA ANTA AHSANUL KHALQE\nany maligner comprehend your virtues. You were the best of creation \nعِبَادَۃً وَ اَخْلَصُهُمْ زَهَادَۃً وَ اَذَّبُهُمْ \nE’BAADATAN WA AKHLASOHUM ZAHAADATAN WA AZZABOHUM\nin the matter of worship and the most sincere \nعَنِ الدِّیْنِ اَقَمْتَ حُدُوْدَ اﷲِ \nA’NID DEENE AQAMTA HODOODALLAAHE\nin abstinence and the most defending of the religion.\nبِجُهْدِكَ وَ فَلَكَ عَسَاكِرَ الْمَارِقِیْنَ \nBE JOHADEKA WA FALAKA A’SAAKERAL MAAREQEENA\nYou strove to uphold the limits imposed by Allah and defeated the enemies of the deviated ones \nبِسَیْفِكَ تُخْمِدُ لَهَبَ الْحُرُوْبِ \nBE SAYFEKA TUKHMEDO LAHABAL HOROOBE\nby your sword and you doused the fire of war \nبِبَنَانِكَ وَ تَهْتِكُ سُتُوْرَ الشُّبَهِ \nBEBANAANEKA WA TAHTEKO SOTOORASH SHOBAHE\nby your power and you tore to shreds the curtains of doubts \nبِبَیَانِكَ وَ تَكْشِفُ لَبْسَ الْبَاطِلِ \nBE BAYAANEKA WA TAKSHEFO LABSAL BAATELE\nby your oratory and you exposed the deception of falsehood \nعَنْ صَرِیْحِ الْحَقِّ لاَ تَاْخُذُكَ فِی اﷲِ \nA’N SAREEHIL HAQQE LAA TAAKHOZOKA FIL LAAHE\nby explanation of truth. The slandering of any slanderer \nلَوْمَۃُ لآَئِمٍ وَ فِیْ مَدْحِ اﷲِ تَعَالٰی لَكَ \nLAUMATO LAAEMIN WA FEE MADHILLAAHE TA-A’ALAA LAKA\ndid not bother you in the way of Allah and your praising by Allah \nغِنًی عَنْ مَدْحِ الْمَادِحِیْنَ وَ تَقْرِیْظِ \nGHENAN A’N MADHIL MAADEHEENA WA TAQREEZIL\nmade you needless of the praises of the praising ones \nالْوَاصِفِیْنَ قَالَ اﷲُ تَعَالٰی مِنَ \nWAASEFEENA QAALALLAAHO TA-A’ALAA MENAL\nand the attribution by those who do so. Allah, the Exalted, said, ‘From the men \nالْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ رِجَالٌ صَدَقُوْا مَا عَاهَدُوْا \nMOMINEENA REJAALUN SADAQOO MAA A’AHADUL\nare those who fulfill their covenant then from those \nاﷲَ عَلَیْهِ فَمِنْهُمْ مَنْ قَضٰی نَحْبَهٗ\nLAAHA A’LAYHE FAMINHUM MAN QAZAA NAHBAHU\nare some who have departed from this world \nوَ مِنْهُمْ مَنْ یَنْتَظِرُ وَ مَا بَدَّلُوْا تَبْدِیْلاً \nWA MINHUM MAN YANTAZER WA MAA BADDALOO TABDEELAN\nand some are awaiting and they have not changed a thing \nوَلَمَّا رَاَیْتَ اَنْ قَتَلْتَ النَّاكِثِیْنَ \nWA LAMMA RA-AYATA AN QATALTAN NAAKESEENA\nand when you saw that you were fighting against the covenant, \nوَالْقَاسِطِیْنَ وَالْمَارِقِیْنَ وَ صَدَقَكَ \nWAL QAASETEENA WAL MAAREQEENA WA SADAQAKA\nbreakers, the oppressers and the deviated ones \nرَسُوْلُ اﷲِ صَلَّی اﷲُ عَلَیْهِ وَ اٰلِهٖ \nRASOOLULLAAHE SALLALLAAHO A’LAYHE WA AALEHI\nand the Apostle of Allah, Blessings of Allah be on him and his progeny \nوَعْدَهٗ فَاَوْفَیْتَ بِعَهْدِهٖ قُلْتَ اَمَا اٰنَ \nWA’DAHU FA-AWAFAYTA BE A’HDEHI QULTA AMAA ANA\nhad fulfilled his promise to you, then you too observed your covenant which you had made to him. You said, \nاَنْ تُخْضَبَ هٰذِهٖ مِنْ هٰذِهٖ اَمْ مَتٰی \nAN TUKHZABA HAAZEHI MIN HAAZEHI MATAA\nHas the time not arrived that my beard be dyed with the blood of my head. \nیُبْعَثُ اَشْقَاهَا وَاثِقًا بِاَنَّكَ عَلٰی بَیِّنَۃٍ \nYUB-A’SO ASHQAAHAA WAASEQAN BEANNAKA A’LAA BAYYENATIN\nWhen will the most unfortunate one of the nation, \nمِنْ رَبِّكَ وَ بَصِیْرَۃٍ \nMIN RABBEKA WA BASEERATIN\nentrusted for this action rise up. Surely, you were on a proof from your Lord and had foresight \nمِنْ اَمْرِكَ قَادِمٌ  عَلَی اﷲِ \nMIN AMREKA QAADEMUN A’LALLAAHE\nin your affair. Proceeding towards Allah, \nمُسْتَبْشِرٌ بِبَیْعِكَ الَّذِیْ \nMUSTAB-SHERUN BE BAYE’KALLAZEE\nreceiving glad tidings of the trading that \nبَایَعْتَهٗ بِهٖ وَ ذٰلِكَ هُوَ الْفَوْزُ الْعَظِیْمُ \nBAAYA’TAHU BEHI WA ZAALEKA HOWAL FAWZUL A’ZEEMO\nyou have performed with Him and that is a great success. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ قَتَلَۃَ اَنْبِیَآئِكَ وَ اَوْصِیَآئِ \nALLAAHUMMALA’N QATALATA ANBEYAAA-EKA WA AWSEYAAA-E\nO Allah, you curse the killers of Your Prophets and the vicegerents \nاَنْبِیَآئِكَ بِجَمِیْعِ لَعَنَاتِكَ وَ اَصْلِهِمْ \nANBEYAAA-EKA BE JAMEE-E’ LA’NAATEKA WA ASLEHIM\nof Your Prophets by all Your curse and throw them \nحَرَّ نَارِكَ وَ الْعَنْ مَنْ غَصَبَ وَلِیَّكَ \nHARRA NAAREKA WAL-A’N MAN GHASABA WALEEYYAKA\nin Your Hell fire and curse the one who usurped the right of \nحَقَّهٗ وَ اَنْكَرَ عَهْدَهٗ وَ جَحَدَهٗ بَعْدَ \nHAQQAHU WA ANKARA A’HDAHU WA JAHADAHU BA’DAL\nYour representative and rejected his covenant and denied him after \nالْیَقِیْنِ وَالْاِقْرَارِ بِالْوِلاَیَۃِ لَهٗ یَوْمَ \nYAQEENE WAL IQRAARE BIL WELAAYATE LAHU YAWMA\nbeing certain and after affirming to his mastership on the day \nاَكْمَلْتَ لَهُ الدِّیْنَ \nAKMALTA LAHUD DEENA\nwhen You perfected the religion for him\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ قَتَلَۃَ اَمِیْرِ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَ \nALLAAHUMMAL-A’N QATALATA AMEERIL MOMINEENA WA\nO Allah! Curse the killers of the leader of the faithful and \nمَنْ ظَلَمَهٗ وَ اَشْیَاعَهُمْ وَاَنْصَارَهُمْ \nMAN ZALAMAHU WA ASHYAA-A’HUM WA ANSAARAHUM\nthose who oppressed him and their adherents and their helpers.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ ظَالِمِیْ الْحُسَیْنِ \nALLAAHUMMAL-A’N ZAALEMIL HUSAYNE\nO Allah! Curse those who have oppressed Husayn \nوَ قَاتِلِیْهِ وَالْمُتَابِعِیْنَ عَدُوَّهٗ وَ \nWA QAATELEEHE WAL MOTAABE-E’ENA A’DOOWWAHU WA\nand killed him and those who followed his enemies \nنَاصِرِیْهِ وَالرَّاضِیْنَ بِقَتْلِهٖ وَ خَاذِلِیْهِ لَعْنًا وَ بِیْلاً \nNAASEREEHE WAR RAAZEENA BE QATLEHI WA KHAZELEEHE LA’NAN WABEELAN\nand their aides and those who are satisfied with his killing and those who forsook him with a calamitous cursing. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ الْعَنْ اَوَّلَ ظَالِمٍ ظَلَمَ اٰلَ \nALLAAHUMMALA’N AWWALA ZAALEMIN ZALAMA AALE\nO Allah! Curse the first oppressor who oppressed the progeny \nمُحَمَّدٍ وَمَانَعِیْهِمْ حُقُوْقَهُمْ \nMOHAMMADIN WA MAA-NA-E’EHIM HOQOOQAHUM\nof Mohammad and denied them their rights.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ خُصَّ اَوَّلَ ظَالِمٍ وَ غَاصِبٍ \nALLAAHUMMA KHUSSA AWWALA ZAALEMIN WAGHAASEBIN\nO Allah! Mark out the first oppressor and usurper \nلِاٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ بِاللَّعْنِ وَ كُلَّ مُسْتَنٍّ بِمَا \nLEAALE MOHAMMADIN BIL LA’NE WA KULLA MUSTANNIN BEMAA\nof the progeny of Mohammad with curse and all those who treaded such a \nسَنَّ اِلٰی یَوْمِ الْقِیٰمَۃِ \nSANNA ELAA YAWMIL QEYAAMATE\npath till the Day of Judgement.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلٰی مُحَمَّدٍ خَاتَمِ \nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADIN KHAATAMIN\nO Allah! Bless Mohammad the last \nالنَّبِیِّیْنَ وَ عَلٰی عَلِیٍّ سَیِّدِ الْوَصِیِّیْنَ \nNABIYYEENA WA A’LAA A’LIYYIN SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA\nof the Prophets and Ali, the leader of the vicegerents \nوَاٰلِهِ الطَّاهِرِیْنَ وَاجْعَلْنَا بِهِمْ \nWA AALEHIT TAAHEREENA WAJ-A’LNAA BEHIM\nand his pure progeny and include us with them, \nمُتَمَسِّكِیْنَ وَ بِوِلاَیَتِهِمْ مِنَ الْفَآئِزِیْنَ \nMOTAMASSEKEENA WA BE WELAAYATEHIM MENAL FAAEZEENAL\nbeing attached to them and being successful \nالْاٰمِنِیْنَ الَّذِیْنَ لاَ خَوْفٌ عَلَیْهِمْ \nAAMENEENALLAZEENA LAA KHAWFUN A’LAYHIM\nthrough their mastership, among those who have no fear \nوَلاَ هُمْ یَحْزَنُوْنَ\nWA LAA HUM YAHZANOONA\nand neither do they grieve."
}
